window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/owner-courses/b386-4d007501d8cd698e.json"]={sha256:"4d007501d8cd698e10a013efc0afa58dcd4b7c050898184495b4d9eb03d44f18",value:{"id":"b386","title":"地下車站活塞風控制","titleEn":"Piston-wind control in underground stations","category":"rail","kind":"course","status":"guided","contentStatus":"reviewable-educational-curriculum","summary":"本課聚焦列車活塞效應旁通開口與壓力瞬變。從列車誘導壓力量級建立物理或資訊邊界，接著把風機與活塞作用疊合與壓力量測誤差合成連成可驗證的介面，最後以不同列車通過情境整理證據。學徒逐一完成機制推導、數值算例、失效辨識及參數實驗，所有練習限定在離線模型或隔離教具，保留假設與量測的不確定度。","summaryEn":"This course studies train piston effects bypass openings and pressure transients. Start with scale of train-induced pressure to define physical or information boundaries, connect fans interacting with piston effects with combining pressure measurement uncertainty as verifiable interfaces, and organize evidence through scenarios for different train passages. Each unit develops a mechanism, numerical example, failure diagnosis and parameter experiment in an offline model or isolated teaching rig, retaining assumptions and measurement uncertainty.","scope":"依公開工程原理、官方資料與規範架構編寫的原創教學；步驟是可驗證的學習任務與假想算例，不是設計圖說、施工計畫、軌道進入、牽引供電隔離或列車營運許可，也不是任何專案的設計文件。數值均為教學假設或公開資料，實際工程須由合格技師依規範與實測資料重新計算並簽證。","scopeEn":"Original teaching built from public engineering principles, official sources and code frameworks. Steps are verifiable learning tasks and hypothetical exercises, not design drawings, method statements, track-access, traction-power isolation or train-operation permits, or any project's design documents. Numbers are teaching assumptions or public data; real work must be recalculated and certified by qualified engineers using codes and measured data.","subcategory":"rail-integration","subcategoryTitle":"車站機廠與系統整合","subcategoryTitleEn":"Stations depots and integration","learningTrack":"rail","learningSubdiscipline":"rail-integration","learningTags":["rail","rail-integration","station"],"architectureFamily":"rail-integration","architectureNodes":[["列車通過","Train passage"],["隧道空氣","Tunnel air"],["旁通開口","Bypass opening"],["月台門壓力","Platform door pressure"],["同步量測","Synchronized measurement"]],"architectureEdges":[[0,1],[1,2],[2,3],[3,4],[4,1]],"diagram":{"type":"rail-integration","labels":["列車通過","隧道空氣","旁通開口","月台門壓力","同步量測"],"labelsEn":["Train passage","Tunnel air","Bypass opening","Platform door pressure","Synchronized measurement"],"original":true,"notToScale":true},"workedExample":{"title":"原創假想算例與邊界","titleEn":"Original hypothetical example and boundaries","text":"原創整合工作單，所有輸入均為教學假設而非代表工程實測：先研究列車誘導壓力量級。原創假想教學輸入：空氣密度 rho=1.2 kg/m3；代表風速 v=15 m/s。公式 y=0.5*rho*v*v，代入得 y=135 Pa。邊界：低馬赫數局部量級估算，不是全隧道壓力波解。敏感度只改 v=15 至 16.5 m/s，輸出變為 163.35 Pa；離散計數採整數變化。再獨立研究活塞風斷面積分：原創假想教學輸入：體積流量 Q=32 m3/s；有效通風面積 A=16 m2。公式 y=Q/A，代入得 y=2 m/s。邊界：不可壓縮均勻截面平均，未求解火災浮力、毒性或能見度。兩個結果不能因同一課程就任意相加，必須先確認單位、因果順序及共同邊界。本單元以局部風速平方比較壓力量級，保留列車阻塞率與波反射尚未求解的差異。最後提出一項量測能區分模型假設失效與儀器偏差，將輸入表、重算結果和適用限制一併交付。","textEn":"Original integrated worksheet; every input is a teaching assumption rather than a measurement from a reference project. First investigate scale of train-induced pressure. Original hypothetical teaching inputs: air density rho=1.2 kg/m3; representative air speed v=15 m/s. Formula y=0.5*rho*v*v gives y=135 Pa. Boundary: Local low-Mach-number scale estimate, not a tunnel-wide pressure-wave solution. For sensitivity, change only v=15 to 16.5 m/s; the output becomes 163.35 Pa. Discrete counts use whole-number steps. Independently investigate section integration of piston airflow: Original hypothetical teaching inputs: volume flow Q=32 m3/s; effective airflow area A=16 m2. Formula y=Q/A gives y=2 m/s. Boundary: Incompressible cross-section mean; fire buoyancy, toxicity and visibility are not solved. Results cannot be added merely because they belong to the same course: check units, causal sequence and shared boundaries first. Compare pressure scales using local air-speed squared, retaining the unsolved influence of train blockage and wave reflection. Propose one measurement distinguishing a failed model assumption from instrument bias, and deliver the input table, recomputed results and applicability limits together.","assumptions":"數值是本課自行設定的教學假設，不代表任何專案的設計值、量測值或規範允許值；改變系統邊界或荷載組合後必須重算。","assumptionsEn":"Inputs are teaching assumptions, not any project's design values, measurements or code allowances; recalculate after changing the system boundary or load combination.","sourceScope":"原創數值練習；來源支援公開原理與工程背景，不宣稱來源提供這組數據。","sourceScopeEn":"Original numerical exercise; sources support public principles and project context, not these numbers."},"depth":5,"languageCoverage":["zh-TW","en"],"simulationOnly":true,"educationEdition":16,"enrichmentVersion":16,"stages":[{"id":"b386-v16-s1","title":"列車誘導壓力量級與活塞風斷面積分","titleEn":"Scale of train-induced pressure & Section integration of piston airflow","description":"本階段聚焦「列車誘導壓力量級」與「活塞風斷面積分」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Scale of train-induced pressure\" and \"Section integration of piston airflow\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b386-v16-01","title":"列車誘導壓力量級：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Scale of train-induced pressure: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"],"prerequisiteIds":[],"objective":"說明「列車誘導壓力量級」如何影響地下車站活塞風控制的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Scale of train-induced pressure” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Piston-wind control in underground stations”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"本單元以局部風速平方比較壓力量級，保留列車阻塞率與波反射尚未求解的差異。動壓與風速平方成正比，這有助判斷列車活塞作用與門扇負載的量級。實際瞬變壓力仍受隧道阻塞率、旁通開口與波傳反射影響；動壓不是任何測點必定出現的靜壓差，兩者不能直接等同。解釋前先固定模型適用範圍：低馬赫數局部量級估算，不是全隧道壓力波解。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「列車誘導壓力量級」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Compare pressure scales using local air-speed squared, retaining the unsolved influence of train blockage and wave reflection. Dynamic pressure scales with speed squared, helping estimate the magnitude of train-induced airflow and door loading. Actual transients also depend on blockage, bypass openings and wave reflections. Dynamic pressure is not automatically the static pressure difference measured at a particular location. Before interpreting the result, fix its domain: Local low-Mach-number scale estimate, not a tunnel-wide pressure-wave solution. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Scale of train-induced pressure” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：原創假想教學輸入：空氣密度 rho=1.2 kg/m3；代表風速 v=15 m/s。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Original hypothetical teaching inputs: air density rho=1.2 kg/m3; representative air speed v=15 m/s.","failure":"常見誤解：「風速加倍時動壓也只會跟著加倍」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Doubling air speed merely doubles dynamic pressure.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「列車誘導壓力量級」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Scale of train-induced pressure”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b386-v16-01-k1","title":"列車誘導壓力量級","titleEn":"Scale of train-induced pressure","text":"本單元以局部風速平方比較壓力量級，保留列車阻塞率與波反射尚未求解的差異。動壓與風速平方成正比，這有助判斷列車活塞作用與門扇負載的量級。","textEn":"Compare pressure scales using local air-speed squared, retaining the unsolved influence of train blockage and wave reflection. Dynamic pressure scales with speed squared, helping estimate the magnitude of train-induced airflow and door loading.","sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"]},{"id":"b386-v16-01-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：風速加倍時動壓也只會跟著加倍 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Doubling air speed merely doubles dynamic pressure. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「列車誘導壓力量級」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Scale of train-induced pressure\" is correct?","options":["風速加倍時動壓也只會跟著加倍","本單元以局部風速平方比較壓力量級，保留列車阻塞率與波反射尚未求解的差異。","一個測點風速符合目標就能證明整個煙流場符合需求"],"optionsEn":["Doubling air speed merely doubles dynamic pressure.","Compare pressure scales using local air-speed squared, retaining the unsolved influence of train blockage and wave reflection.","One velocity reading at target proves that the entire smoke-flow field meets requirements."],"answer":1,"explanation":"本單元以局部風速平方比較壓力量級，保留列車阻塞率與波反射尚未求解的差異。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Compare pressure scales using local air-speed squared, retaining the unsolved influence of train blockage and wave reflection. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":1},{"id":"b386-v16-02","title":"列車誘導壓力量級：定量估算","titleEn":"Scale of train-induced pressure: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"],"prerequisiteIds":["b386-v16-01"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「列車誘導壓力量級」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、速度、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Scale of train-induced pressure” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, speed, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：原創假想教學輸入：空氣密度 rho=1.2 kg/m3；代表風速 v=15 m/s。公式 y=0.5*rho*v*v，代入得 y=135 Pa。邊界：低馬赫數局部量級估算，不是全隧道壓力波解。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（連續量可增加 10%；計數須保持整數；分貝量使用加減值），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Original hypothetical teaching inputs: air density rho=1.2 kg/m3; representative air speed v=15 m/s. Formula y=0.5*rho*v*v gives y=135 Pa. Boundary: Local low-Mach-number scale estimate, not a tunnel-wide pressure-wave solution. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example +10% for a continuous quantity; retain integers for counts and use additive changes for decibels), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：同步量測列車速度、局部風速與兩側靜壓，觀察峰值時刻及符號是否相符。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Synchronize train speed, local air speed and static pressure on both sides, comparing peak timing and sign.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b386-v16-02-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"原創假想教學輸入：空氣密度 rho=1.2 kg/m3；代表風速 v=15 m/s。公式 y=0.5*rho*v*v，代入得 y=135 Pa。邊界：低馬赫數局部量級估算，不是全隧道壓力波解。","textEn":"Original hypothetical teaching inputs: air density rho=1.2 kg/m3; representative air speed v=15 m/s. Formula y=0.5*rho*v*v gives y=135 Pa. Boundary: Local low-Mach-number scale estimate, not a tunnel-wide pressure-wave solution.","sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"]},{"id":"b386-v16-02-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real system, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「列車誘導壓力量級」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Scale of train-induced pressure\", which statement holds?","options":["風機馬達正在轉動就表示所需通風量一定已達成","測試開始時時鐘一致就能保證整天時間戳都一致","原創假想教學輸入：空氣密度 rho=1.2 kg/m3；代表風速 v=15 m/s。"],"optionsEn":["A running fan motor proves that the required airflow has been achieved.","Clocks aligned at test start remain aligned for the entire day.","Original hypothetical teaching inputs: air density rho=1.2 kg/m3; representative air speed v=15 m/s."],"answer":2,"explanation":"原創假想教學輸入：空氣密度 rho=1.2 kg/m3；代表風速 v=15 m/s。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Original hypothetical teaching inputs: air density rho=1.2 kg/m3; representative air speed v=15 m/s. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":2},{"id":"b386-v16-03","title":"列車誘導壓力量級：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Scale of train-induced pressure: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"],"prerequisiteIds":["b386-v16-02"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「列車誘導壓力量級」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Scale of train-induced pressure” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"同步量測列車速度、局部風速與兩側靜壓，觀察峰值時刻及符號是否相符。以「列車誘導壓力量級」為驗證目標，先寫出預期變化方向及可分辨的替代原因，再保存原始讀值、單位、校正版本與時間窗。只有比較同一系統邊界的資料，才判定殘差是否支持這項機制。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Synchronize train speed, local air speed and static pressure on both sides, comparing peak timing and sign. For scale of train-induced pressure, state the expected direction and distinguishable alternative causes before collecting data. Retain raw readings, units, calibration version and observation window. Compare evidence within the same system boundary before deciding whether the residual supports this mechanism. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：只把代表風速 v 從 15 改成 16.5 m/s（增加百分之十），其餘輸入固定。重算結果應由 135 變為 163.35 Pa。先說明「列車誘導壓力量級」中變化的因果方向，再檢查適用邊界是否仍成立，提交計算與一個可反駁此解釋的觀測。","observationEn":"Site practice: Change only representative air speed v from 15 to 16.5 m/s (increase by ten percent), holding other inputs fixed. Recalculate 135 to 163.35 Pa. Explain the causal direction for scale of train-induced pressure, check that the stated boundary still holds, and submit the calculation plus one observation that could refute the explanation.","failure":"注意干擾：把測壓管朝向流動形成的總壓誤當靜壓會高估門扇負載，時間平均又可能掩蓋短暫峰值。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、速度與操作條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: A probe facing the flow can measure total rather than static pressure and overstate door loading; time averaging can hide transient peaks. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, speed and operating conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b386-v16-03-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"同步量測列車速度、局部風速與兩側靜壓，觀察峰值時刻及符號是否相符。以「列車誘導壓力量級」為驗證目標，先寫出預期變化方向及可分辨的替代原因，再保存原始讀值、單位、校正版本與時間窗。只有比較同一系統邊界的資料，才判定殘差是否支持這項機制。","textEn":"Synchronize train speed, local air speed and static pressure on both sides, comparing peak timing and sign. For scale of train-induced pressure, state the expected direction and distinguishable alternative causes before collecting data. Retain raw readings, units, calibration version and observation window. Compare evidence within the same system boundary before deciding whether the residual supports this mechanism.","sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"]},{"id":"b386-v16-03-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"只把代表風速 v 從 15 改成 16.5 m/s（增加百分之十），其餘輸入固定。重算結果應由 135 變為 163.35 Pa。先說明「列車誘導壓力量級」中變化的因果方向，再檢查適用邊界是否仍成立，提交計算與一個可反駁此解釋的觀測。","textEn":"Change only representative air speed v from 15 to 16.5 m/s (increase by ten percent), holding other inputs fixed. Recalculate 135 to 163.35 Pa. Explain the causal direction for scale of train-induced pressure, check that the stated boundary still holds, and submit the calculation plus one observation that could refute the explanation.","sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「列車誘導壓力量級」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Scale of train-induced pressure\"?","options":["同步量測列車速度、局部風速與兩側靜壓，觀察峰值時刻及符號是否相符。","量測時不必記錄溫度、速度、運行歷程與施工荷重，因為它們不會影響結果。","每個子系統平均很快就代表整體最壞延遲一定很短"],"optionsEn":["Synchronize train speed, local air speed and static pressure on both sides, comparing peak timing and sign.","Temperature, speed, operating history and construction loads need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","Fast average subsystems guarantee a short worst-case end-to-end delay."],"answer":0,"explanation":"同步量測列車速度、局部風速與兩側靜壓，觀察峰值時刻及符號是否相符。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Synchronize train speed, local air speed and static pressure on both sides, comparing peak timing and sign. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":3},{"id":"b386-v16-04","title":"列車誘導壓力量級：失效診斷","titleEn":"Scale of train-induced pressure: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"],"prerequisiteIds":["b386-v16-03"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「列車誘導壓力量級」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Scale of train-induced pressure” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"把測壓管朝向流動形成的總壓誤當靜壓會高估門扇負載，時間平均又可能掩蓋短暫峰值。回到「列車誘導壓力量級」的輸入鏈逐項定位；先重播單一異常，再比較共同原因的組合。保留不確定項，避免為了讓結果符合預期而刪去不利證據。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體系統的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"A probe facing the flow can measure total rather than static pressure and overstate door loading; time averaging can hide transient peaks. Trace the input chain for scale of train-induced pressure. Replay one anomaly first, then compare common-cause combinations. Retain uncertain observations rather than discarding adverse evidence to force the expected conclusion. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：解釋前先固定模型適用範圍：低馬赫數局部量級估算，不是全隧道壓力波解。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Before interpreting the result, fix its domain: Local low-Mach-number scale estimate, not a tunnel-wide pressure-wave solution.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「風速加倍時動壓也只會跟著加倍」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Doubling air speed merely doubles dynamic pressure.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b386-v16-04-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"把測壓管朝向流動形成的總壓誤當靜壓會高估門扇負載，時間平均又可能掩蓋短暫峰值。回到「列車誘導壓力量級」的輸入鏈逐項定位；先重播單一異常，再比較共同原因的組合。保留不確定項，避免為了讓結果符合預期而刪去不利證據。","textEn":"A probe facing the flow can measure total rather than static pressure and overstate door loading; time averaging can hide transient peaks. Trace the input chain for scale of train-induced pressure. Replay one anomaly first, then compare common-cause combinations. Retain uncertain observations rather than discarding adverse evidence to force the expected conclusion.","sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"]},{"id":"b386-v16-04-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「列車誘導壓力量級」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Scale of train-induced pressure\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自施工人員失誤，設計與細部不需要檢討。","把測壓管朝向流動形成的總壓誤當靜壓會高估門扇負載，時間平均又可能掩蓋短暫峰值。","一個測點風速符合目標就能證明整個煙流場符合需求"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is a workmanship error, so design and detailing never need review.","A probe facing the flow can measure total rather than static pressure and overstate door loading; time averaging can hide transient peaks.","One velocity reading at target proves that the entire smoke-flow field meets requirements."],"answer":1,"explanation":"把測壓管朝向流動形成的總壓誤當靜壓會高估門扇負載，時間平均又可能掩蓋短暫峰值。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"A probe facing the flow can measure total rather than static pressure and overstate door loading; time averaging can hide transient peaks. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":4},{"id":"b386-v16-05","title":"活塞風斷面積分：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Section integration of piston airflow: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"],"prerequisiteIds":["b386-v16-04"],"objective":"說明「活塞風斷面積分」如何影響地下車站活塞風控制的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Section integration of piston airflow” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Piston-wind control in underground stations”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"本單元在列車進出站期間量測有正負號的速度，防止正反流動被平均後誤判為持續單向送風。平均風速是流量除以有效斷面，局部阻塞與流場分離可讓同一平均值對應很不均勻的速度。風向與煙氣來源位置同樣重要；正常通風的舒適性目標和火災時的煙流控制目標不能共用一個數字就視為完成驗證。解釋前先固定模型適用範圍：不可壓縮均勻截面平均，未求解火災浮力、毒性或能見度。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「活塞風斷面積分」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Measure signed velocity during train entry and departure, preventing reversing flow from being mistaken for sustained one-way ventilation. Mean air speed is flow divided by effective area, but obstruction and separation can produce highly nonuniform fields at the same mean. Direction and smoke-source location also matter. Normal comfort ventilation and emergency smoke control cannot be validated by one shared number alone. Before interpreting the result, fix its domain: Incompressible cross-section mean; fire buoyancy, toxicity and visibility are not solved. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Section integration of piston airflow” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：原創假想教學輸入：體積流量 Q=32 m3/s；有效通風面積 A=16 m2。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Original hypothetical teaching inputs: volume flow Q=32 m3/s; effective airflow area A=16 m2.","failure":"常見誤解：「一個測點風速符合目標就能證明整個煙流場符合需求」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"One velocity reading at target proves that the entire smoke-flow field meets requirements.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「活塞風斷面積分」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Section integration of piston airflow”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b386-v16-05-k1","title":"活塞風斷面積分","titleEn":"Section integration of piston airflow","text":"本單元在列車進出站期間量測有正負號的速度，防止正反流動被平均後誤判為持續單向送風。平均風速是流量除以有效斷面，局部阻塞與流場分離可讓同一平均值對應很不均勻的速度。","textEn":"Measure signed velocity during train entry and departure, preventing reversing flow from being mistaken for sustained one-way ventilation. Mean air speed is flow divided by effective area, but obstruction and separation can produce highly nonuniform fields at the same mean.","sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"]},{"id":"b386-v16-05-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：一個測點風速符合目標就能證明整個煙流場符合需求 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: One velocity reading at target proves that the entire smoke-flow field meets requirements. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「活塞風斷面積分」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Section integration of piston airflow\" is correct?","options":["一個測點風速符合目標就能證明整個煙流場符合需求","開口壓差增加四倍時流量一定增加四倍","本單元在列車進出站期間量測有正負號的速度，防止正反流動被平均後誤判為持續單向送風。"],"optionsEn":["One velocity reading at target proves that the entire smoke-flow field meets requirements.","Quadrupling pressure difference necessarily quadruples opening flow.","Measure signed velocity during train entry and departure, preventing reversing flow from being mistaken for sustained one-way ventilation."],"answer":2,"explanation":"本單元在列車進出站期間量測有正負號的速度，防止正反流動被平均後誤判為持續單向送風。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Measure signed velocity during train entry and departure, preventing reversing flow from being mistaken for sustained one-way ventilation. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":5},{"id":"b386-v16-06","title":"活塞風斷面積分：定量估算","titleEn":"Section integration of piston airflow: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"],"prerequisiteIds":["b386-v16-05"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「活塞風斷面積分」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、速度、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Section integration of piston airflow” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, speed, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：原創假想教學輸入：體積流量 Q=32 m3/s；有效通風面積 A=16 m2。公式 y=Q/A，代入得 y=2 m/s。邊界：不可壓縮均勻截面平均，未求解火災浮力、毒性或能見度。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（連續量可增加 10%；計數須保持整數；分貝量使用加減值），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Original hypothetical teaching inputs: volume flow Q=32 m3/s; effective airflow area A=16 m2. Formula y=Q/A gives y=2 m/s. Boundary: Incompressible cross-section mean; fire buoyancy, toxicity and visibility are not solved. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example +10% for a continuous quantity; retain integers for counts and use additive changes for decibels), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：在斷面多點量測速度與方向，積分得到流量，再檢查門開閉或列車位置變化。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Measure velocity and direction at several section points, integrate flow, and repeat for changed door or train positions.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b386-v16-06-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"原創假想教學輸入：體積流量 Q=32 m3/s；有效通風面積 A=16 m2。公式 y=Q/A，代入得 y=2 m/s。邊界：不可壓縮均勻截面平均，未求解火災浮力、毒性或能見度。","textEn":"Original hypothetical teaching inputs: volume flow Q=32 m3/s; effective airflow area A=16 m2. Formula y=Q/A gives y=2 m/s. Boundary: Incompressible cross-section mean; fire buoyancy, toxicity and visibility are not solved.","sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"]},{"id":"b386-v16-06-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real system, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「活塞風斷面積分」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Section integration of piston airflow\", which statement holds?","options":["原創假想教學輸入：體積流量 Q=32 m3/s；有效通風面積 A=16 m2。","把相鄰壓力資料內插成更多點就能恢復任何短暫峰值","任何兩個誤差都可以不問相關性直接平方和開根號"],"optionsEn":["Original hypothetical teaching inputs: volume flow Q=32 m3/s; effective airflow area A=16 m2.","Interpolating extra points between pressure observations can recover every brief pressure peak.","Any two errors can be combined by root-sum-square without considering correlation."],"answer":0,"explanation":"原創假想教學輸入：體積流量 Q=32 m3/s；有效通風面積 A=16 m2。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Original hypothetical teaching inputs: volume flow Q=32 m3/s; effective airflow area A=16 m2. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":6},{"id":"b386-v16-07","title":"活塞風斷面積分：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Section integration of piston airflow: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"],"prerequisiteIds":["b386-v16-06"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「活塞風斷面積分」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Section integration of piston airflow” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"在斷面多點量測速度與方向，積分得到流量，再檢查門開閉或列車位置變化。以「活塞風斷面積分」為驗證目標，先寫出預期變化方向及可分辨的替代原因，再保存原始讀值、單位、校正版本與時間窗。只有比較同一系統邊界的資料，才判定殘差是否支持這項機制。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Measure velocity and direction at several section points, integrate flow, and repeat for changed door or train positions. For section integration of piston airflow, state the expected direction and distinguishable alternative causes before collecting data. Retain raw readings, units, calibration version and observation window. Compare evidence within the same system boundary before deciding whether the residual supports this mechanism. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：只把有效通風面積 A 從 16 改成 17.6 m2（增加百分之十），其餘輸入固定。重算結果應由 2 變為 1.81818 m/s。先說明「活塞風斷面積分」中變化的因果方向，再檢查適用邊界是否仍成立，提交計算與一個可反駁此解釋的觀測。","observationEn":"Site practice: Change only effective airflow area A from 16 to 17.6 m2 (increase by ten percent), holding other inputs fixed. Recalculate 2 to 1.81818 m/s. Explain the causal direction for section integration of piston airflow, check that the stated boundary still holds, and submit the calculation plus one observation that could refute the explanation.","failure":"注意干擾：單點風速可剛好量到高速射流而高估全斷面流量，反向區域也可能被平均抵消。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、速度與操作條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: One sensor may sample a fast jet and overstate total flow; reverse-flow regions can disappear in an unsigned average. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, speed and operating conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b386-v16-07-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"在斷面多點量測速度與方向，積分得到流量，再檢查門開閉或列車位置變化。以「活塞風斷面積分」為驗證目標，先寫出預期變化方向及可分辨的替代原因，再保存原始讀值、單位、校正版本與時間窗。只有比較同一系統邊界的資料，才判定殘差是否支持這項機制。","textEn":"Measure velocity and direction at several section points, integrate flow, and repeat for changed door or train positions. For section integration of piston airflow, state the expected direction and distinguishable alternative causes before collecting data. Retain raw readings, units, calibration version and observation window. Compare evidence within the same system boundary before deciding whether the residual supports this mechanism.","sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"]},{"id":"b386-v16-07-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"只把有效通風面積 A 從 16 改成 17.6 m2（增加百分之十），其餘輸入固定。重算結果應由 2 變為 1.81818 m/s。先說明「活塞風斷面積分」中變化的因果方向，再檢查適用邊界是否仍成立，提交計算與一個可反駁此解釋的觀測。","textEn":"Change only effective airflow area A from 16 to 17.6 m2 (increase by ten percent), holding other inputs fixed. Recalculate 2 to 1.81818 m/s. Explain the causal direction for section integration of piston airflow, check that the stated boundary still holds, and submit the calculation plus one observation that could refute the explanation.","sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「活塞風斷面積分」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Section integration of piston airflow\"?","options":["沿用另一處鐵路設施或路線的量測結果，就可視為本工程已完成驗證。","在斷面多點量測速度與方向，積分得到流量，再檢查門開閉或列車位置變化。","狀態變數多一個只會多出一種狀態組合"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another railway facility or route counts as verifying this structure.","Measure velocity and direction at several section points, integrate flow, and repeat for changed door or train positions.","Adding one Boolean state variable creates only one additional combination."],"answer":1,"explanation":"在斷面多點量測速度與方向，積分得到流量，再檢查門開閉或列車位置變化。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Measure velocity and direction at several section points, integrate flow, and repeat for changed door or train positions. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":7},{"id":"b386-v16-08","title":"活塞風斷面積分：失效診斷","titleEn":"Section integration of piston airflow: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"],"prerequisiteIds":["b386-v16-07"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「活塞風斷面積分」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Section integration of piston airflow” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"單點風速可剛好量到高速射流而高估全斷面流量，反向區域也可能被平均抵消。回到「活塞風斷面積分」的輸入鏈逐項定位；先重播單一異常，再比較共同原因的組合。保留不確定項，避免為了讓結果符合預期而刪去不利證據。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體系統的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"One sensor may sample a fast jet and overstate total flow; reverse-flow regions can disappear in an unsigned average. Trace the input chain for section integration of piston airflow. Replay one anomaly first, then compare common-cause combinations. Retain uncertain observations rather than discarding adverse evidence to force the expected conclusion. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：解釋前先固定模型適用範圍：不可壓縮均勻截面平均，未求解火災浮力、毒性或能見度。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Before interpreting the result, fix its domain: Incompressible cross-section mean; fire buoyancy, toxicity and visibility are not solved.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「一個測點風速符合目標就能證明整個煙流場符合需求」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"One velocity reading at target proves that the entire smoke-flow field meets requirements.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b386-v16-08-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"單點風速可剛好量到高速射流而高估全斷面流量，反向區域也可能被平均抵消。回到「活塞風斷面積分」的輸入鏈逐項定位；先重播單一異常，再比較共同原因的組合。保留不確定項，避免為了讓結果符合預期而刪去不利證據。","textEn":"One sensor may sample a fast jet and overstate total flow; reverse-flow regions can disappear in an unsigned average. Trace the input chain for section integration of piston airflow. Replay one anomaly first, then compare common-cause combinations. Retain uncertain observations rather than discarding adverse evidence to force the expected conclusion.","sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"]},{"id":"b386-v16-08-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「活塞風斷面積分」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Section integration of piston airflow\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["補一層塗料或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數劣化問題。","開口壓差增加四倍時流量一定增加四倍","單點風速可剛好量到高速射流而高估全斷面流量，反向區域也可能被平均抵消。"],"optionsEn":["Adding a coat of paint or widening the acceptance limits solves most deterioration problems.","Quadrupling pressure difference necessarily quadruples opening flow.","One sensor may sample a fast jet and overstate total flow; reverse-flow regions can disappear in an unsigned average."],"answer":2,"explanation":"單點風速可剛好量到高速射流而高估全斷面流量，反向區域也可能被平均抵消。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"One sensor may sample a fast jet and overstate total flow; reverse-flow regions can disappear in an unsigned average. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":8}],"order":1},{"id":"b386-v16-s2","title":"旁通開口壓差流量與風機與活塞作用疊合","titleEn":"Pressure-driven bypass flow & Fans interacting with piston effects","description":"本階段聚焦「旁通開口壓差流量」與「風機與活塞作用疊合」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Pressure-driven bypass flow\" and \"Fans interacting with piston effects\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b386-v16-09","title":"旁通開口壓差流量：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Pressure-driven bypass flow: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"],"prerequisiteIds":["b386-v16-08"],"objective":"說明「旁通開口壓差流量」如何影響地下車站活塞風控制的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Pressure-driven bypass flow” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Piston-wind control in underground stations”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"本單元比較旁通面積增加對流量的影響，另外追蹤煙流模式是否因新增連通路徑而改變。開口通風量由壓差驅動，受面積與縮流損失共同控制。流量和壓差平方根成正比，不是線性比例；旁通開口增加可能減輕壓力卻同時改變煙氣路徑，因此開口位置和通風模式必須一起討論。解釋前先固定模型適用範圍：固定流量係數的不可壓縮孔口近似，未含雙向分層流。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「旁通開口壓差流量」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Compare the effect of increased bypass area on flow and separately track whether the added connection changes smoke-control paths. Pressure difference drives opening flow, with area and contraction losses jointly controlling it. Flow scales with the square root of pressure rather than linearly. Adding a bypass can relieve pressure while changing smoke paths, so location and ventilation mode must be considered together. Before interpreting the result, fix its domain: Incompressible orifice approximation with fixed coefficient; bidirectional stratified flow is excluded. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Pressure-driven bypass flow” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：原創假想教學輸入：流量係數 Cd=0.65 1；開口面積 A=4 m2；兩側壓差 dp=80 Pa；空氣密度 rho=1.2 kg/m3。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Original hypothetical teaching inputs: discharge coefficient Cd=0.65 1; opening area A=4 m2; pressure difference dp=80 Pa; air density rho=1.2 kg/m3.","failure":"常見誤解：「開口壓差增加四倍時流量一定增加四倍」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Quadrupling pressure difference necessarily quadruples opening flow.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「旁通開口壓差流量」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Pressure-driven bypass flow”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b386-v16-09-k1","title":"旁通開口壓差流量","titleEn":"Pressure-driven bypass flow","text":"本單元比較旁通面積增加對流量的影響，另外追蹤煙流模式是否因新增連通路徑而改變。開口通風量由壓差驅動，受面積與縮流損失共同控制。","textEn":"Compare the effect of increased bypass area on flow and separately track whether the added connection changes smoke-control paths. Pressure difference drives opening flow, with area and contraction losses jointly controlling it.","sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"]},{"id":"b386-v16-09-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：開口壓差增加四倍時流量一定增加四倍 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Quadrupling pressure difference necessarily quadruples opening flow. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「旁通開口壓差流量」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Pressure-driven bypass flow\" is correct?","options":["本單元比較旁通面積增加對流量的影響，另外追蹤煙流模式是否因新增連通路徑而改變。","開口壓差增加四倍時流量一定增加四倍","風機馬達正在轉動就表示所需通風量一定已達成"],"optionsEn":["Compare the effect of increased bypass area on flow and separately track whether the added connection changes smoke-control paths.","Quadrupling pressure difference necessarily quadruples opening flow.","A running fan motor proves that the required airflow has been achieved."],"answer":0,"explanation":"本單元比較旁通面積增加對流量的影響，另外追蹤煙流模式是否因新增連通路徑而改變。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Compare the effect of increased bypass area on flow and separately track whether the added connection changes smoke-control paths. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":9},{"id":"b386-v16-10","title":"旁通開口壓差流量：定量估算","titleEn":"Pressure-driven bypass flow: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"],"prerequisiteIds":["b386-v16-09"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「旁通開口壓差流量」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、速度、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Pressure-driven bypass flow” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, speed, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：原創假想教學輸入：流量係數 Cd=0.65 1；開口面積 A=4 m2；兩側壓差 dp=80 Pa；空氣密度 rho=1.2 kg/m3。公式 y=Cd*A*sqrt(2*dp/rho)，代入得 y=30.0222 m3/s。邊界：固定流量係數的不可壓縮孔口近似，未含雙向分層流。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（連續量可增加 10%；計數須保持整數；分貝量使用加減值），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Original hypothetical teaching inputs: discharge coefficient Cd=0.65 1; opening area A=4 m2; pressure difference dp=80 Pa; air density rho=1.2 kg/m3. Formula y=Cd*A*sqrt(2*dp/rho) gives y=30.0222 m3/s. Boundary: Incompressible orifice approximation with fixed coefficient; bidirectional stratified flow is excluded. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example +10% for a continuous quantity; retain integers for counts and use additive changes for decibels), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：量測開口兩側壓差與斷面流量，將不同開度下的結果畫成流量對壓差平方根。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Measure pressure difference and section flow, then plot flow against square-root pressure for several openings.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b386-v16-10-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"原創假想教學輸入：流量係數 Cd=0.65 1；開口面積 A=4 m2；兩側壓差 dp=80 Pa；空氣密度 rho=1.2 kg/m3。公式 y=Cd*A*sqrt(2*dp/rho)，代入得 y=30.0222 m3/s。邊界：固定流量係數的不可壓縮孔口近似，未含雙向分層流。","textEn":"Original hypothetical teaching inputs: discharge coefficient Cd=0.65 1; opening area A=4 m2; pressure difference dp=80 Pa; air density rho=1.2 kg/m3. Formula y=Cd*A*sqrt(2*dp/rho) gives y=30.0222 m3/s. Boundary: Incompressible orifice approximation with fixed coefficient; bidirectional stratified flow is excluded.","sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"]},{"id":"b386-v16-10-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real system, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「旁通開口壓差流量」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Pressure-driven bypass flow\", which statement holds?","options":["測試開始時時鐘一致就能保證整天時間戳都一致","原創假想教學輸入：流量係數 Cd=0.65 1；開口面積 A=4 m2；兩側壓差 dp=80 Pa；空氣密度 rho=1.2 kg/m3。","每個子系統平均很快就代表整體最壞延遲一定很短"],"optionsEn":["Clocks aligned at test start remain aligned for the entire day.","Original hypothetical teaching inputs: discharge coefficient Cd=0.65 1; opening area A=4 m2; pressure difference dp=80 Pa; air density rho=1.2 kg/m3.","Fast average subsystems guarantee a short worst-case end-to-end delay."],"answer":1,"explanation":"原創假想教學輸入：流量係數 Cd=0.65 1；開口面積 A=4 m2；兩側壓差 dp=80 Pa；空氣密度 rho=1.2 kg/m3。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Original hypothetical teaching inputs: discharge coefficient Cd=0.65 1; opening area A=4 m2; pressure difference dp=80 Pa; air density rho=1.2 kg/m3. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":10},{"id":"b386-v16-11","title":"旁通開口壓差流量：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Pressure-driven bypass flow: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"],"prerequisiteIds":["b386-v16-10"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「旁通開口壓差流量」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Pressure-driven bypass flow” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"量測開口兩側壓差與斷面流量，將不同開度下的結果畫成流量對壓差平方根。以「旁通開口壓差流量」為驗證目標，先寫出預期變化方向及可分辨的替代原因，再保存原始讀值、單位、校正版本與時間窗。只有比較同一系統邊界的資料，才判定殘差是否支持這項機制。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Measure pressure difference and section flow, then plot flow against square-root pressure for several openings. For pressure-driven bypass flow, state the expected direction and distinguishable alternative causes before collecting data. Retain raw readings, units, calibration version and observation window. Compare evidence within the same system boundary before deciding whether the residual supports this mechanism. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：只把兩側壓差 dp 從 80 改成 88 Pa（增加百分之十），其餘輸入固定。重算結果應由 30.0222 變為 31.4876 m3/s。先說明「旁通開口壓差流量」中變化的因果方向，再檢查適用邊界是否仍成立，提交計算與一個可反駁此解釋的觀測。","observationEn":"Site practice: Change only pressure difference dp from 80 to 88 Pa (increase by ten percent), holding other inputs fixed. Recalculate 30.0222 to 31.4876 m3/s. Explain the causal direction for pressure-driven bypass flow, check that the stated boundary still holds, and submit the calculation plus one observation that could refute the explanation.","failure":"注意干擾：格柵堵塞會改變有效面積與損失係數，僅看風門命令開度可能誤判實際旁通能力。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、速度與操作條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Blocked grilles alter effective area and loss coefficient; commanded damper opening can misrepresent actual bypass capacity. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, speed and operating conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b386-v16-11-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"量測開口兩側壓差與斷面流量，將不同開度下的結果畫成流量對壓差平方根。以「旁通開口壓差流量」為驗證目標，先寫出預期變化方向及可分辨的替代原因，再保存原始讀值、單位、校正版本與時間窗。只有比較同一系統邊界的資料，才判定殘差是否支持這項機制。","textEn":"Measure pressure difference and section flow, then plot flow against square-root pressure for several openings. For pressure-driven bypass flow, state the expected direction and distinguishable alternative causes before collecting data. Retain raw readings, units, calibration version and observation window. Compare evidence within the same system boundary before deciding whether the residual supports this mechanism.","sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"]},{"id":"b386-v16-11-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"只把兩側壓差 dp 從 80 改成 88 Pa（增加百分之十），其餘輸入固定。重算結果應由 30.0222 變為 31.4876 m3/s。先說明「旁通開口壓差流量」中變化的因果方向，再檢查適用邊界是否仍成立，提交計算與一個可反駁此解釋的觀測。","textEn":"Change only pressure difference dp from 80 to 88 Pa (increase by ten percent), holding other inputs fixed. Recalculate 30.0222 to 31.4876 m3/s. Explain the causal direction for pressure-driven bypass flow, check that the stated boundary still holds, and submit the calculation plus one observation that could refute the explanation.","sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「旁通開口壓差流量」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Pressure-driven bypass flow\"?","options":["只看一次讀值或外觀即可判定合格，不需要基準點、參考試體或重複量測。","測試覆蓋率達到百分之百就等於零故障風險","量測開口兩側壓差與斷面流量，將不同開度下的結果畫成流量對壓差平方根。"],"optionsEn":["A single reading or a visual impression is enough to accept the work; no datum, reference specimen or repeat measurement is needed.","One hundred percent test coverage means zero failure risk.","Measure pressure difference and section flow, then plot flow against square-root pressure for several openings."],"answer":2,"explanation":"量測開口兩側壓差與斷面流量，將不同開度下的結果畫成流量對壓差平方根。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Measure pressure difference and section flow, then plot flow against square-root pressure for several openings. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":11},{"id":"b386-v16-12","title":"旁通開口壓差流量：失效診斷","titleEn":"Pressure-driven bypass flow: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"],"prerequisiteIds":["b386-v16-11"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「旁通開口壓差流量」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Pressure-driven bypass flow” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"格柵堵塞會改變有效面積與損失係數，僅看風門命令開度可能誤判實際旁通能力。回到「旁通開口壓差流量」的輸入鏈逐項定位；先重播單一異常，再比較共同原因的組合。保留不確定項，避免為了讓結果符合預期而刪去不利證據。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體系統的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Blocked grilles alter effective area and loss coefficient; commanded damper opening can misrepresent actual bypass capacity. Trace the input chain for pressure-driven bypass flow. Replay one anomaly first, then compare common-cause combinations. Retain uncertain observations rather than discarding adverse evidence to force the expected conclusion. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：解釋前先固定模型適用範圍：固定流量係數的不可壓縮孔口近似，未含雙向分層流。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Before interpreting the result, fix its domain: Incompressible orifice approximation with fixed coefficient; bidirectional stratified flow is excluded.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「開口壓差增加四倍時流量一定增加四倍」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Quadrupling pressure difference necessarily quadruples opening flow.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b386-v16-12-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"格柵堵塞會改變有效面積與損失係數，僅看風門命令開度可能誤判實際旁通能力。回到「旁通開口壓差流量」的輸入鏈逐項定位；先重播單一異常，再比較共同原因的組合。保留不確定項，避免為了讓結果符合預期而刪去不利證據。","textEn":"Blocked grilles alter effective area and loss coefficient; commanded damper opening can misrepresent actual bypass capacity. Trace the input chain for pressure-driven bypass flow. Replay one anomaly first, then compare common-cause combinations. Retain uncertain observations rather than discarding adverse evidence to force the expected conclusion.","sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"]},{"id":"b386-v16-12-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「旁通開口壓差流量」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Pressure-driven bypass flow\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["格柵堵塞會改變有效面積與損失係數，僅看風門命令開度可能誤判實際旁通能力。","裂縫或異常只出現一次就可以忽略，不需要記錄或追蹤。","風機馬達正在轉動就表示所需通風量一定已達成"],"optionsEn":["Blocked grilles alter effective area and loss coefficient; commanded damper opening can misrepresent actual bypass capacity.","A crack or anomaly that appears only once can be ignored without logging or follow-up.","A running fan motor proves that the required airflow has been achieved."],"answer":0,"explanation":"格柵堵塞會改變有效面積與損失係數，僅看風門命令開度可能誤判實際旁通能力。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Blocked grilles alter effective area and loss coefficient; commanded damper opening can misrepresent actual bypass capacity. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":12},{"id":"b386-v16-13","title":"風機與活塞作用疊合：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Fans interacting with piston effects: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"],"prerequisiteIds":["b386-v16-12"],"objective":"說明「風機與活塞作用疊合」如何影響地下車站活塞風控制的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Fans interacting with piston effects” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Piston-wind control in underground stations”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"本單元以穩態功率帳作基準，再標記列車通過造成的工作點偏移，避免假設風機流量始終固定。風機輸入功率由流量乘壓升再除效率估算。壓力不足與流路阻力增加都會改變工作點，不能把銘牌額定流量視為任何風道中都能達成；備援風機還可能共享同一阻塞路徑而無法提供預想的獨立能力。解釋前先固定模型適用範圍：單一穩態工作點，未含風機曲線、失速或高溫效率變動。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「風機與活塞作用疊合」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Use a steady power balance as a reference, then mark operating-point shifts during train passage instead of assuming constant fan flow. Fan input power is flow times pressure rise divided by efficiency. Inadequate pressure and increased duct resistance shift the operating point; nameplate flow is not guaranteed in every duct. Redundant fans may also share a blocked path and fail to provide the expected independent capability. Before interpreting the result, fix its domain: One steady operating point without fan-curve shape, stall or high-temperature efficiency change. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Fans interacting with piston effects” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：原創假想教學輸入：流量 Q=40 m3/s；總壓升 dp=600 Pa；總效率 eta=0.7 1。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Original hypothetical teaching inputs: flow Q=40 m3/s; total pressure rise dp=600 Pa; overall efficiency eta=0.7 1.","failure":"常見誤解：「風機馬達正在轉動就表示所需通風量一定已達成」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A running fan motor proves that the required airflow has been achieved.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「風機與活塞作用疊合」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Fans interacting with piston effects”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b386-v16-13-k1","title":"風機與活塞作用疊合","titleEn":"Fans interacting with piston effects","text":"本單元以穩態功率帳作基準，再標記列車通過造成的工作點偏移，避免假設風機流量始終固定。風機輸入功率由流量乘壓升再除效率估算。","textEn":"Use a steady power balance as a reference, then mark operating-point shifts during train passage instead of assuming constant fan flow. Fan input power is flow times pressure rise divided by efficiency.","sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"]},{"id":"b386-v16-13-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：風機馬達正在轉動就表示所需通風量一定已達成 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A running fan motor proves that the required airflow has been achieved. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「風機與活塞作用疊合」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Fans interacting with piston effects\" is correct?","options":["風機馬達正在轉動就表示所需通風量一定已達成","本單元以穩態功率帳作基準，再標記列車通過造成的工作點偏移，避免假設風機流量始終固定。","把相鄰壓力資料內插成更多點就能恢復任何短暫峰值"],"optionsEn":["A running fan motor proves that the required airflow has been achieved.","Use a steady power balance as a reference, then mark operating-point shifts during train passage instead of assuming constant fan flow.","Interpolating extra points between pressure observations can recover every brief pressure peak."],"answer":1,"explanation":"本單元以穩態功率帳作基準，再標記列車通過造成的工作點偏移，避免假設風機流量始終固定。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Use a steady power balance as a reference, then mark operating-point shifts during train passage instead of assuming constant fan flow. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":13},{"id":"b386-v16-14","title":"風機與活塞作用疊合：定量估算","titleEn":"Fans interacting with piston effects: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"],"prerequisiteIds":["b386-v16-13"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「風機與活塞作用疊合」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、速度、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Fans interacting with piston effects” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, speed, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：原創假想教學輸入：流量 Q=40 m3/s；總壓升 dp=600 Pa；總效率 eta=0.7 1。公式 y=Q*dp/eta/1000，代入得 y=34.2857 kW。邊界：單一穩態工作點，未含風機曲線、失速或高溫效率變動。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（連續量可增加 10%；計數須保持整數；分貝量使用加減值），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Original hypothetical teaching inputs: flow Q=40 m3/s; total pressure rise dp=600 Pa; overall efficiency eta=0.7 1. Formula y=Q*dp/eta/1000 gives y=34.2857 kW. Boundary: One steady operating point without fan-curve shape, stall or high-temperature efficiency change. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example +10% for a continuous quantity; retain integers for counts and use additive changes for decibels), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：同時量測流量、前後壓差與電功率，對照風門位置並檢查各項能量是否一致。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Measure flow, pressure rise and electrical power together, correlate with damper position, and check energy consistency.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b386-v16-14-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"原創假想教學輸入：流量 Q=40 m3/s；總壓升 dp=600 Pa；總效率 eta=0.7 1。公式 y=Q*dp/eta/1000，代入得 y=34.2857 kW。邊界：單一穩態工作點，未含風機曲線、失速或高溫效率變動。","textEn":"Original hypothetical teaching inputs: flow Q=40 m3/s; total pressure rise dp=600 Pa; overall efficiency eta=0.7 1. Formula y=Q*dp/eta/1000 gives y=34.2857 kW. Boundary: One steady operating point without fan-curve shape, stall or high-temperature efficiency change.","sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"]},{"id":"b386-v16-14-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real system, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「風機與活塞作用疊合」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Fans interacting with piston effects\", which statement holds?","options":["任何兩個誤差都可以不問相關性直接平方和開根號","狀態變數多一個只會多出一種狀態組合","原創假想教學輸入：流量 Q=40 m3/s；總壓升 dp=600 Pa；總效率 eta=0.7 1。"],"optionsEn":["Any two errors can be combined by root-sum-square without considering correlation.","Adding one Boolean state variable creates only one additional combination.","Original hypothetical teaching inputs: flow Q=40 m3/s; total pressure rise dp=600 Pa; overall efficiency eta=0.7 1."],"answer":2,"explanation":"原創假想教學輸入：流量 Q=40 m3/s；總壓升 dp=600 Pa；總效率 eta=0.7 1。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Original hypothetical teaching inputs: flow Q=40 m3/s; total pressure rise dp=600 Pa; overall efficiency eta=0.7 1. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":14},{"id":"b386-v16-15","title":"風機與活塞作用疊合：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Fans interacting with piston effects: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"],"prerequisiteIds":["b386-v16-14"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「風機與活塞作用疊合」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Fans interacting with piston effects” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"同時量測流量、前後壓差與電功率，對照風門位置並檢查各項能量是否一致。以「風機與活塞作用疊合」為驗證目標，先寫出預期變化方向及可分辨的替代原因，再保存原始讀值、單位、校正版本與時間窗。只有比較同一系統邊界的資料，才判定殘差是否支持這項機制。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Measure flow, pressure rise and electrical power together, correlate with damper position, and check energy consistency. For fans interacting with piston effects, state the expected direction and distinguishable alternative causes before collecting data. Retain raw readings, units, calibration version and observation window. Compare evidence within the same system boundary before deciding whether the residual supports this mechanism. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：只把總壓升 dp 從 600 改成 660 Pa（增加百分之十），其餘輸入固定。重算結果應由 34.2857 變為 37.7143 kW。先說明「風機與活塞作用疊合」中變化的因果方向，再檢查適用邊界是否仍成立，提交計算與一個可反駁此解釋的觀測。","observationEn":"Site practice: Change only total pressure rise dp from 600 to 660 Pa (increase by ten percent), holding other inputs fixed. Recalculate 34.2857 to 37.7143 kW. Explain the causal direction for fans interacting with piston effects, check that the stated boundary still holds, and submit the calculation plus one observation that could refute the explanation.","failure":"注意干擾：風門位置回授正常但機械連桿脫落會形成錯誤狀態，僅看馬達運轉訊號無法證明有足夠送風。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、速度與操作條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: A detached damper linkage can coexist with apparently normal position feedback; a motor-running signal does not prove adequate airflow. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, speed and operating conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b386-v16-15-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"同時量測流量、前後壓差與電功率，對照風門位置並檢查各項能量是否一致。以「風機與活塞作用疊合」為驗證目標，先寫出預期變化方向及可分辨的替代原因，再保存原始讀值、單位、校正版本與時間窗。只有比較同一系統邊界的資料，才判定殘差是否支持這項機制。","textEn":"Measure flow, pressure rise and electrical power together, correlate with damper position, and check energy consistency. For fans interacting with piston effects, state the expected direction and distinguishable alternative causes before collecting data. Retain raw readings, units, calibration version and observation window. Compare evidence within the same system boundary before deciding whether the residual supports this mechanism.","sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"]},{"id":"b386-v16-15-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"只把總壓升 dp 從 600 改成 660 Pa（增加百分之十），其餘輸入固定。重算結果應由 34.2857 變為 37.7143 kW。先說明「風機與活塞作用疊合」中變化的因果方向，再檢查適用邊界是否仍成立，提交計算與一個可反駁此解釋的觀測。","textEn":"Change only total pressure rise dp from 600 to 660 Pa (increase by ten percent), holding other inputs fixed. Recalculate 34.2857 to 37.7143 kW. Explain the causal direction for fans interacting with piston effects, check that the stated boundary still holds, and submit the calculation plus one observation that could refute the explanation.","sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「風機與活塞作用疊合」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Fans interacting with piston effects\"?","options":["同時量測流量、前後壓差與電功率，對照風門位置並檢查各項能量是否一致。","不確定度太難估計，報告中只寫最佳值即可。","風速加倍時動壓也只會跟著加倍"],"optionsEn":["Measure flow, pressure rise and electrical power together, correlate with damper position, and check energy consistency.","Uncertainty is too hard to estimate, so the report may state only the best value.","Doubling air speed merely doubles dynamic pressure."],"answer":0,"explanation":"同時量測流量、前後壓差與電功率，對照風門位置並檢查各項能量是否一致。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Measure flow, pressure rise and electrical power together, correlate with damper position, and check energy consistency. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":15},{"id":"b386-v16-16","title":"風機與活塞作用疊合：失效診斷","titleEn":"Fans interacting with piston effects: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"],"prerequisiteIds":["b386-v16-15"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「風機與活塞作用疊合」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Fans interacting with piston effects” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"風門位置回授正常但機械連桿脫落會形成錯誤狀態，僅看馬達運轉訊號無法證明有足夠送風。回到「風機與活塞作用疊合」的輸入鏈逐項定位；先重播單一異常，再比較共同原因的組合。保留不確定項，避免為了讓結果符合預期而刪去不利證據。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體系統的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"A detached damper linkage can coexist with apparently normal position feedback; a motor-running signal does not prove adequate airflow. Trace the input chain for fans interacting with piston effects. Replay one anomaly first, then compare common-cause combinations. Retain uncertain observations rather than discarding adverse evidence to force the expected conclusion. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：解釋前先固定模型適用範圍：單一穩態工作點，未含風機曲線、失速或高溫效率變動。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Before interpreting the result, fix its domain: One steady operating point without fan-curve shape, stall or high-temperature efficiency change.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「風機馬達正在轉動就表示所需通風量一定已達成」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A running fan motor proves that the required airflow has been achieved.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b386-v16-16-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"風門位置回授正常但機械連桿脫落會形成錯誤狀態，僅看馬達運轉訊號無法證明有足夠送風。回到「風機與活塞作用疊合」的輸入鏈逐項定位；先重播單一異常，再比較共同原因的組合。保留不確定項，避免為了讓結果符合預期而刪去不利證據。","textEn":"A detached damper linkage can coexist with apparently normal position feedback; a motor-running signal does not prove adequate airflow. Trace the input chain for fans interacting with piston effects. Replay one anomaly first, then compare common-cause combinations. Retain uncertain observations rather than discarding adverse evidence to force the expected conclusion.","sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"]},{"id":"b386-v16-16-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「風機與活塞作用疊合」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Fans interacting with piston effects\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["先更換最貴的構件；只要症狀消失，就代表已找到根因。","風門位置回授正常但機械連桿脫落會形成錯誤狀態，僅看馬達運轉訊號無法證明有足夠送風。","把相鄰壓力資料內插成更多點就能恢復任何短暫峰值"],"optionsEn":["Replace the most expensive component first; if the symptom disappears, the root cause has been found.","A detached damper linkage can coexist with apparently normal position feedback; a motor-running signal does not prove adequate airflow.","Interpolating extra points between pressure observations can recover every brief pressure peak."],"answer":1,"explanation":"風門位置回授正常但機械連桿脫落會形成錯誤狀態，僅看馬達運轉訊號無法證明有足夠送風。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"A detached damper linkage can coexist with apparently normal position feedback; a motor-running signal does not prove adequate airflow. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":16}],"order":2},{"id":"b386-v16-s3","title":"壓力峰值取樣解析與列車風壓事件同步","titleEn":"Sampling resolution for pressure peaks & Synchronizing train and pressure events","description":"本階段聚焦「壓力峰值取樣解析」與「列車風壓事件同步」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Sampling resolution for pressure peaks\" and \"Synchronizing train and pressure events\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b386-v16-17","title":"壓力峰值取樣解析：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Sampling resolution for pressure peaks: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"],"prerequisiteIds":["b386-v16-16"],"objective":"說明「壓力峰值取樣解析」如何影響地下車站活塞風控制的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Sampling resolution for pressure peaks” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Piston-wind control in underground stations”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"本單元由壓力取樣頻率直接計算相鄰時間間隔，檢查感測頻寬、濾波及取樣是否會漏掉門負載的短暫峰值。壓力時間序列的相鄰樣點間隔由取樣頻率倒數決定，短於此間隔的事件可能完全落在兩點之間。提高頻率仍需要適當感測頻寬與抗混疊濾波，資料記錄器和感測器中較慢的一環會限制真實解析度；只增加輸出的資料筆數不會補回已被濾掉的峰值。解釋前先固定模型適用範圍：等間隔時間取樣，未代表感測器頻寬或峰值重建精度。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「壓力峰值取樣解析」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Calculate time intervals directly from pressure sampling frequency and examine whether sensor bandwidth, filtering or sampling misses brief door-load peaks. The interval between pressure samples is the reciprocal of sampling frequency, so an event shorter than that interval can fall entirely between observations. A higher rate still needs appropriate sensor bandwidth and anti-alias filtering. The slower part of the sensor-recorder chain limits actual resolution; producing more output rows cannot restore an already filtered peak. Before interpreting the result, fix its domain: Equally spaced temporal samples, not sensor bandwidth or peak-reconstruction accuracy. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Sampling resolution for pressure peaks” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：原創假想教學輸入：壓力取樣頻率 f=20 Hz。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Original hypothetical teaching inputs: pressure sampling frequency f=20 Hz.","failure":"常見誤解：「把相鄰壓力資料內插成更多點就能恢復任何短暫峰值」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Interpolating extra points between pressure observations can recover every brief pressure peak.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「壓力峰值取樣解析」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Sampling resolution for pressure peaks”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b386-v16-17-k1","title":"壓力峰值取樣解析","titleEn":"Sampling resolution for pressure peaks","text":"本單元由壓力取樣頻率直接計算相鄰時間間隔，檢查感測頻寬、濾波及取樣是否會漏掉門負載的短暫峰值。壓力時間序列的相鄰樣點間隔由取樣頻率倒數決定，短於此間隔的事件可能完全落在兩點之間。","textEn":"Calculate time intervals directly from pressure sampling frequency and examine whether sensor bandwidth, filtering or sampling misses brief door-load peaks. The interval between pressure samples is the reciprocal of sampling frequency, so an event shorter than that interval can fall entirely between observations.","sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"]},{"id":"b386-v16-17-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：把相鄰壓力資料內插成更多點就能恢復任何短暫峰值 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Interpolating extra points between pressure observations can recover every brief pressure peak. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「壓力峰值取樣解析」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Sampling resolution for pressure peaks\" is correct?","options":["把相鄰壓力資料內插成更多點就能恢復任何短暫峰值","測試開始時時鐘一致就能保證整天時間戳都一致","本單元由壓力取樣頻率直接計算相鄰時間間隔，檢查感測頻寬、濾波及取樣是否會漏掉門負載的短暫峰值。"],"optionsEn":["Interpolating extra points between pressure observations can recover every brief pressure peak.","Clocks aligned at test start remain aligned for the entire day.","Calculate time intervals directly from pressure sampling frequency and examine whether sensor bandwidth, filtering or sampling misses brief door-load peaks."],"answer":2,"explanation":"本單元由壓力取樣頻率直接計算相鄰時間間隔，檢查感測頻寬、濾波及取樣是否會漏掉門負載的短暫峰值。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Calculate time intervals directly from pressure sampling frequency and examine whether sensor bandwidth, filtering or sampling misses brief door-load peaks. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":17},{"id":"b386-v16-18","title":"壓力峰值取樣解析：定量估算","titleEn":"Sampling resolution for pressure peaks: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"],"prerequisiteIds":["b386-v16-17"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「壓力峰值取樣解析」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、速度、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Sampling resolution for pressure peaks” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, speed, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：原創假想教學輸入：壓力取樣頻率 f=20 Hz。公式 y=1000/f，代入得 y=50 ms。邊界：等間隔時間取樣，未代表感測器頻寬或峰值重建精度。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（連續量可增加 10%；計數須保持整數；分貝量使用加減值），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Original hypothetical teaching inputs: pressure sampling frequency f=20 Hz. Formula y=1000/f gives y=50 ms. Boundary: Equally spaced temporal samples, not sensor bandwidth or peak-reconstruction accuracy. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example +10% for a continuous quantity; retain integers for counts and use additive changes for decibels), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：以校正器產生已知持續時間的低壓脈衝，對照獨立高頻記錄，保留濾波設定並比較峰值與脈衝面積。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Generate a calibrated low-pressure pulse of known duration, compare with an independent faster recorder, retain filter settings and compare peak and pulse area.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b386-v16-18-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"原創假想教學輸入：壓力取樣頻率 f=20 Hz。公式 y=1000/f，代入得 y=50 ms。邊界：等間隔時間取樣，未代表感測器頻寬或峰值重建精度。","textEn":"Original hypothetical teaching inputs: pressure sampling frequency f=20 Hz. Formula y=1000/f gives y=50 ms. Boundary: Equally spaced temporal samples, not sensor bandwidth or peak-reconstruction accuracy.","sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"]},{"id":"b386-v16-18-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real system, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「壓力峰值取樣解析」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Sampling resolution for pressure peaks\", which statement holds?","options":["原創假想教學輸入：壓力取樣頻率 f=20 Hz。","每個子系統平均很快就代表整體最壞延遲一定很短","測試覆蓋率達到百分之百就等於零故障風險"],"optionsEn":["Original hypothetical teaching inputs: pressure sampling frequency f=20 Hz.","Fast average subsystems guarantee a short worst-case end-to-end delay.","One hundred percent test coverage means zero failure risk."],"answer":0,"explanation":"原創假想教學輸入：壓力取樣頻率 f=20 Hz。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Original hypothetical teaching inputs: pressure sampling frequency f=20 Hz. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":18},{"id":"b386-v16-19","title":"壓力峰值取樣解析：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Sampling resolution for pressure peaks: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"],"prerequisiteIds":["b386-v16-18"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「壓力峰值取樣解析」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Sampling resolution for pressure peaks” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"以校正器產生已知持續時間的低壓脈衝，對照獨立高頻記錄，保留濾波設定並比較峰值與脈衝面積。以「壓力峰值取樣解析」為驗證目標，先寫出預期變化方向及可分辨的替代原因，再保存原始讀值、單位、校正版本與時間窗。只有比較同一系統邊界的資料，才判定殘差是否支持這項機制。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Generate a calibrated low-pressure pulse of known duration, compare with an independent faster recorder, retain filter settings and compare peak and pulse area. For sampling resolution for pressure peaks, state the expected direction and distinguishable alternative causes before collecting data. Retain raw readings, units, calibration version and observation window. Compare evidence within the same system boundary before deciding whether the residual supports this mechanism. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：只把壓力取樣頻率 f 從 20 改成 22 Hz（增加百分之十），其餘輸入固定。重算結果應由 50 變為 45.4545 ms。先說明「壓力峰值取樣解析」中變化的因果方向，再檢查適用邊界是否仍成立，提交計算與一個可反駁此解釋的觀測。","observationEn":"Site practice: Change only pressure sampling frequency f from 20 to 22 Hz (increase by ten percent), holding other inputs fixed. Recalculate 50 to 45.4545 ms. Explain the causal direction for sampling resolution for pressure peaks, check that the stated boundary still holds, and submit the calculation plus one observation that could refute the explanation.","failure":"注意干擾：資料內插會讓曲線平順卻沒有新增觀測，未經抗混疊的高頻擾動也可能折回低頻形成虛假活塞風特徵。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、速度與操作條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Interpolation smooths a curve without adding observations, while unfiltered high-frequency disturbance can alias into an apparent low-frequency piston-flow feature. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, speed and operating conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b386-v16-19-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以校正器產生已知持續時間的低壓脈衝，對照獨立高頻記錄，保留濾波設定並比較峰值與脈衝面積。以「壓力峰值取樣解析」為驗證目標，先寫出預期變化方向及可分辨的替代原因，再保存原始讀值、單位、校正版本與時間窗。只有比較同一系統邊界的資料，才判定殘差是否支持這項機制。","textEn":"Generate a calibrated low-pressure pulse of known duration, compare with an independent faster recorder, retain filter settings and compare peak and pulse area. For sampling resolution for pressure peaks, state the expected direction and distinguishable alternative causes before collecting data. Retain raw readings, units, calibration version and observation window. Compare evidence within the same system boundary before deciding whether the residual supports this mechanism.","sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"]},{"id":"b386-v16-19-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"只把壓力取樣頻率 f 從 20 改成 22 Hz（增加百分之十），其餘輸入固定。重算結果應由 50 變為 45.4545 ms。先說明「壓力峰值取樣解析」中變化的因果方向，再檢查適用邊界是否仍成立，提交計算與一個可反駁此解釋的觀測。","textEn":"Change only pressure sampling frequency f from 20 to 22 Hz (increase by ten percent), holding other inputs fixed. Recalculate 50 to 45.4545 ms. Explain the causal direction for sampling resolution for pressure peaks, check that the stated boundary still holds, and submit the calculation plus one observation that could refute the explanation.","sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「壓力峰值取樣解析」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Sampling resolution for pressure peaks\"?","options":["允收準則可以等看到量測數據後再決定。","以校正器產生已知持續時間的低壓脈衝，對照獨立高頻記錄，保留濾波設定並比較峰值與脈衝面積。","一個測點風速符合目標就能證明整個煙流場符合需求"],"optionsEn":["Acceptance criteria can be decided after the measured data have been seen.","Generate a calibrated low-pressure pulse of known duration, compare with an independent faster recorder, retain filter settings and compare peak and pulse area.","One velocity reading at target proves that the entire smoke-flow field meets requirements."],"answer":1,"explanation":"以校正器產生已知持續時間的低壓脈衝，對照獨立高頻記錄，保留濾波設定並比較峰值與脈衝面積。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Generate a calibrated low-pressure pulse of known duration, compare with an independent faster recorder, retain filter settings and compare peak and pulse area. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":19},{"id":"b386-v16-20","title":"壓力峰值取樣解析：失效診斷","titleEn":"Sampling resolution for pressure peaks: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"],"prerequisiteIds":["b386-v16-19"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「壓力峰值取樣解析」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Sampling resolution for pressure peaks” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"資料內插會讓曲線平順卻沒有新增觀測，未經抗混疊的高頻擾動也可能折回低頻形成虛假活塞風特徵。回到「壓力峰值取樣解析」的輸入鏈逐項定位；先重播單一異常，再比較共同原因的組合。保留不確定項，避免為了讓結果符合預期而刪去不利證據。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體系統的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Interpolation smooths a curve without adding observations, while unfiltered high-frequency disturbance can alias into an apparent low-frequency piston-flow feature. Trace the input chain for sampling resolution for pressure peaks. Replay one anomaly first, then compare common-cause combinations. Retain uncertain observations rather than discarding adverse evidence to force the expected conclusion. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：解釋前先固定模型適用範圍：等間隔時間取樣，未代表感測器頻寬或峰值重建精度。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Before interpreting the result, fix its domain: Equally spaced temporal samples, not sensor bandwidth or peak-reconstruction accuracy.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「把相鄰壓力資料內插成更多點就能恢復任何短暫峰值」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Interpolating extra points between pressure observations can recover every brief pressure peak.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b386-v16-20-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"資料內插會讓曲線平順卻沒有新增觀測，未經抗混疊的高頻擾動也可能折回低頻形成虛假活塞風特徵。回到「壓力峰值取樣解析」的輸入鏈逐項定位；先重播單一異常，再比較共同原因的組合。保留不確定項，避免為了讓結果符合預期而刪去不利證據。","textEn":"Interpolation smooths a curve without adding observations, while unfiltered high-frequency disturbance can alias into an apparent low-frequency piston-flow feature. Trace the input chain for sampling resolution for pressure peaks. Replay one anomaly first, then compare common-cause combinations. Retain uncertain observations rather than discarding adverse evidence to force the expected conclusion.","sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"]},{"id":"b386-v16-20-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「壓力峰值取樣解析」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Sampling resolution for pressure peaks\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["症狀相同就代表原因相同，不必用量測區分。","測試開始時時鐘一致就能保證整天時間戳都一致","資料內插會讓曲線平順卻沒有新增觀測，未經抗混疊的高頻擾動也可能折回低頻形成虛假活塞風特徵。"],"optionsEn":["Identical symptoms always mean identical causes, so no discriminating measurement is needed.","Clocks aligned at test start remain aligned for the entire day.","Interpolation smooths a curve without adding observations, while unfiltered high-frequency disturbance can alias into an apparent low-frequency piston-flow feature."],"answer":2,"explanation":"資料內插會讓曲線平順卻沒有新增觀測，未經抗混疊的高頻擾動也可能折回低頻形成虛假活塞風特徵。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Interpolation smooths a curve without adding observations, while unfiltered high-frequency disturbance can alias into an apparent low-frequency piston-flow feature. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":20},{"id":"b386-v16-21","title":"列車風壓事件同步：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Synchronizing train and pressure events: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"],"prerequisiteIds":["b386-v16-20"],"objective":"說明「列車風壓事件同步」如何影響地下車站活塞風控制的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Synchronizing train and pressure events” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Piston-wind control in underground stations”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"本單元把列車位置、風速與壓力記錄對齊，確保觀察到的先後關係來自流場而不是時鐘漂移。時鐘頻率偏差會隨時間累積成時間差，校時瞬間的偏移與之不同。多系統事件排序若依不同時鐘，可能把因果順序顛倒；校時跳變又會使量測區間長度失真，所以需記錄時鐘品質與校正事件。解釋前先固定模型適用範圍：固定頻率偏差的線性累積，忽略溫度漂移與校時伺服動態。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「列車風壓事件同步」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Align train position, air velocity and pressure logs so observed sequencing reflects the flow field rather than clock drift. Clock frequency error accumulates into time offset and differs from initial synchronization offset. Ordering multisystem events on different clocks can reverse apparent causality. Synchronization jumps can distort interval lengths, so clock quality and correction events must be recorded. Before interpreting the result, fix its domain: Linear accumulation at fixed frequency offset; temperature drift and synchronization-servo dynamics are omitted. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Synchronizing train and pressure events” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：原創假想教學輸入：時鐘頻率偏差 drift=20 ppm；未校時期間 duration=3600 s。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Original hypothetical teaching inputs: clock frequency offset drift=20 ppm; unsynchronized interval duration=3600 s.","failure":"常見誤解：「測試開始時時鐘一致就能保證整天時間戳都一致」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Clocks aligned at test start remain aligned for the entire day.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「列車風壓事件同步」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Synchronizing train and pressure events”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b386-v16-21-k1","title":"列車風壓事件同步","titleEn":"Synchronizing train and pressure events","text":"本單元把列車位置、風速與壓力記錄對齊，確保觀察到的先後關係來自流場而不是時鐘漂移。時鐘頻率偏差會隨時間累積成時間差，校時瞬間的偏移與之不同。","textEn":"Align train position, air velocity and pressure logs so observed sequencing reflects the flow field rather than clock drift. Clock frequency error accumulates into time offset and differs from initial synchronization offset.","sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"]},{"id":"b386-v16-21-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：測試開始時時鐘一致就能保證整天時間戳都一致 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Clocks aligned at test start remain aligned for the entire day. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「列車風壓事件同步」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Synchronizing train and pressure events\" is correct?","options":["本單元把列車位置、風速與壓力記錄對齊，確保觀察到的先後關係來自流場而不是時鐘漂移。","測試開始時時鐘一致就能保證整天時間戳都一致","任何兩個誤差都可以不問相關性直接平方和開根號"],"optionsEn":["Align train position, air velocity and pressure logs so observed sequencing reflects the flow field rather than clock drift.","Clocks aligned at test start remain aligned for the entire day.","Any two errors can be combined by root-sum-square without considering correlation."],"answer":0,"explanation":"本單元把列車位置、風速與壓力記錄對齊，確保觀察到的先後關係來自流場而不是時鐘漂移。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Align train position, air velocity and pressure logs so observed sequencing reflects the flow field rather than clock drift. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":21},{"id":"b386-v16-22","title":"列車風壓事件同步：定量估算","titleEn":"Synchronizing train and pressure events: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"],"prerequisiteIds":["b386-v16-21"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「列車風壓事件同步」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、速度、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Synchronizing train and pressure events” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, speed, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：原創假想教學輸入：時鐘頻率偏差 drift=20 ppm；未校時期間 duration=3600 s。公式 y=drift*1e-6*duration，代入得 y=0.072 s。邊界：固定頻率偏差的線性累積，忽略溫度漂移與校時伺服動態。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（連續量可增加 10%；計數須保持整數；分貝量使用加減值），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Original hypothetical teaching inputs: clock frequency offset drift=20 ppm; unsynchronized interval duration=3600 s. Formula y=drift*1e-6*duration gives y=0.072 s. Boundary: Linear accumulation at fixed frequency offset; temperature drift and synchronization-servo dynamics are omitted. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example +10% for a continuous quantity; retain integers for counts and use additive changes for decibels), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：用獨立時間基準比較多個時刻的偏移，從斜率分辨頻率誤差與一次性跳變。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Compare offsets at several times against an independent reference, using slope to distinguish frequency error from a one-time jump.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b386-v16-22-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"原創假想教學輸入：時鐘頻率偏差 drift=20 ppm；未校時期間 duration=3600 s。公式 y=drift*1e-6*duration，代入得 y=0.072 s。邊界：固定頻率偏差的線性累積，忽略溫度漂移與校時伺服動態。","textEn":"Original hypothetical teaching inputs: clock frequency offset drift=20 ppm; unsynchronized interval duration=3600 s. Formula y=drift*1e-6*duration gives y=0.072 s. Boundary: Linear accumulation at fixed frequency offset; temperature drift and synchronization-servo dynamics are omitted.","sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"]},{"id":"b386-v16-22-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real system, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「列車風壓事件同步」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Synchronizing train and pressure events\", which statement holds?","options":["狀態變數多一個只會多出一種狀態組合","原創假想教學輸入：時鐘頻率偏差 drift=20 ppm；未校時期間 duration=3600 s。","風速加倍時動壓也只會跟著加倍"],"optionsEn":["Adding one Boolean state variable creates only one additional combination.","Original hypothetical teaching inputs: clock frequency offset drift=20 ppm; unsynchronized interval duration=3600 s.","Doubling air speed merely doubles dynamic pressure."],"answer":1,"explanation":"原創假想教學輸入：時鐘頻率偏差 drift=20 ppm；未校時期間 duration=3600 s。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Original hypothetical teaching inputs: clock frequency offset drift=20 ppm; unsynchronized interval duration=3600 s. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":22},{"id":"b386-v16-23","title":"列車風壓事件同步：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Synchronizing train and pressure events: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"],"prerequisiteIds":["b386-v16-22"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「列車風壓事件同步」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Synchronizing train and pressure events” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"用獨立時間基準比較多個時刻的偏移，從斜率分辨頻率誤差與一次性跳變。以「列車風壓事件同步」為驗證目標，先寫出預期變化方向及可分辨的替代原因，再保存原始讀值、單位、校正版本與時間窗。只有比較同一系統邊界的資料，才判定殘差是否支持這項機制。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Compare offsets at several times against an independent reference, using slope to distinguish frequency error from a one-time jump. For synchronizing train and pressure events, state the expected direction and distinguishable alternative causes before collecting data. Retain raw readings, units, calibration version and observation window. Compare evidence within the same system boundary before deciding whether the residual supports this mechanism. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：只把未校時期間 duration 從 3600 改成 3960 s（增加百分之十），其餘輸入固定。重算結果應由 0.072 變為 0.0792 s。先說明「列車風壓事件同步」中變化的因果方向，再檢查適用邊界是否仍成立，提交計算與一個可反駁此解釋的觀測。","observationEn":"Site practice: Change only unsynchronized interval duration from 3600 to 3960 s (increase by ten percent), holding other inputs fixed. Recalculate 0.072 to 0.0792 s. Explain the causal direction for synchronizing train and pressure events, check that the stated boundary still holds, and submit the calculation plus one observation that could refute the explanation.","failure":"注意干擾：只對齊開始時刻卻忽略頻率漂移，會讓長測試中的事件逐漸錯位，並誤判通訊延遲。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、速度與操作條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Aligning only the initial instant leaves frequency drift uncorrected, progressively misaligning events and suggesting false network delay. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, speed and operating conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b386-v16-23-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"用獨立時間基準比較多個時刻的偏移，從斜率分辨頻率誤差與一次性跳變。以「列車風壓事件同步」為驗證目標，先寫出預期變化方向及可分辨的替代原因，再保存原始讀值、單位、校正版本與時間窗。只有比較同一系統邊界的資料，才判定殘差是否支持這項機制。","textEn":"Compare offsets at several times against an independent reference, using slope to distinguish frequency error from a one-time jump. For synchronizing train and pressure events, state the expected direction and distinguishable alternative causes before collecting data. Retain raw readings, units, calibration version and observation window. Compare evidence within the same system boundary before deciding whether the residual supports this mechanism.","sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"]},{"id":"b386-v16-23-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"只把未校時期間 duration 從 3600 改成 3960 s（增加百分之十），其餘輸入固定。重算結果應由 0.072 變為 0.0792 s。先說明「列車風壓事件同步」中變化的因果方向，再檢查適用邊界是否仍成立，提交計算與一個可反駁此解釋的觀測。","textEn":"Change only unsynchronized interval duration from 3600 to 3960 s (increase by ten percent), holding other inputs fixed. Recalculate 0.072 to 0.0792 s. Explain the causal direction for synchronizing train and pressure events, check that the stated boundary still holds, and submit the calculation plus one observation that could refute the explanation.","sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「列車風壓事件同步」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Synchronizing train and pressure events\"?","options":["只要結構分析模型看起來合理，就可以省略現場量測與試驗。","開口壓差增加四倍時流量一定增加四倍","用獨立時間基準比較多個時刻的偏移，從斜率分辨頻率誤差與一次性跳變。"],"optionsEn":["If the structural model looks reasonable, site measurement and testing can be skipped.","Quadrupling pressure difference necessarily quadruples opening flow.","Compare offsets at several times against an independent reference, using slope to distinguish frequency error from a one-time jump."],"answer":2,"explanation":"用獨立時間基準比較多個時刻的偏移，從斜率分辨頻率誤差與一次性跳變。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Compare offsets at several times against an independent reference, using slope to distinguish frequency error from a one-time jump. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":23},{"id":"b386-v16-24","title":"列車風壓事件同步：失效診斷","titleEn":"Synchronizing train and pressure events: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"],"prerequisiteIds":["b386-v16-23"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「列車風壓事件同步」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Synchronizing train and pressure events” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"只對齊開始時刻卻忽略頻率漂移，會讓長測試中的事件逐漸錯位，並誤判通訊延遲。回到「列車風壓事件同步」的輸入鏈逐項定位；先重播單一異常，再比較共同原因的組合。保留不確定項，避免為了讓結果符合預期而刪去不利證據。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體系統的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Aligning only the initial instant leaves frequency drift uncorrected, progressively misaligning events and suggesting false network delay. Trace the input chain for synchronizing train and pressure events. Replay one anomaly first, then compare common-cause combinations. Retain uncertain observations rather than discarding adverse evidence to force the expected conclusion. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：解釋前先固定模型適用範圍：固定頻率偏差的線性累積，忽略溫度漂移與校時伺服動態。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Before interpreting the result, fix its domain: Linear accumulation at fixed frequency offset; temperature drift and synchronization-servo dynamics are omitted.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「測試開始時時鐘一致就能保證整天時間戳都一致」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Clocks aligned at test start remain aligned for the entire day.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b386-v16-24-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"只對齊開始時刻卻忽略頻率漂移，會讓長測試中的事件逐漸錯位，並誤判通訊延遲。回到「列車風壓事件同步」的輸入鏈逐項定位；先重播單一異常，再比較共同原因的組合。保留不確定項，避免為了讓結果符合預期而刪去不利證據。","textEn":"Aligning only the initial instant leaves frequency drift uncorrected, progressively misaligning events and suggesting false network delay. Trace the input chain for synchronizing train and pressure events. Replay one anomaly first, then compare common-cause combinations. Retain uncertain observations rather than discarding adverse evidence to force the expected conclusion.","sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"]},{"id":"b386-v16-24-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「列車風壓事件同步」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Synchronizing train and pressure events\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["只對齊開始時刻卻忽略頻率漂移，會讓長測試中的事件逐漸錯位，並誤判通訊延遲。","只要結構還沒倒，就代表安全餘裕仍然足夠。","任何兩個誤差都可以不問相關性直接平方和開根號"],"optionsEn":["Aligning only the initial instant leaves frequency drift uncorrected, progressively misaligning events and suggesting false network delay.","As long as the structure is still standing, its safety margin must still be adequate.","Any two errors can be combined by root-sum-square without considering correlation."],"answer":0,"explanation":"只對齊開始時刻卻忽略頻率漂移，會讓長測試中的事件逐漸錯位，並誤判通訊延遲。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Aligning only the initial instant leaves frequency drift uncorrected, progressively misaligning events and suggesting false network delay. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":24}],"order":3},{"id":"b386-v16-s4","title":"壓力量測誤差合成與風門反應時間鏈","titleEn":"Combining pressure measurement uncertainty & Damper-response timing chain","description":"本階段聚焦「壓力量測誤差合成」與「風門反應時間鏈」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Combining pressure measurement uncertainty\" and \"Damper-response timing chain\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b386-v16-25","title":"壓力量測誤差合成：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Combining pressure measurement uncertainty: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"],"prerequisiteIds":["b386-v16-24"],"objective":"說明「壓力量測誤差合成」如何影響地下車站活塞風控制的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Combining pressure measurement uncertainty” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Piston-wind control in underground stations”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"本單元以帕斯卡為單位合成兩個獨立壓力通道的標準差，另列共用參考壓力與校正偏差以避免低估不確定度。獨立零均值誤差的變異數可以相加，因此標準差以平方和開根號合成。這個做法不適合直接合併最大容差或共同偏差；一旦共享基準造成相關性，協方差項就必須回到計算中，不能繼續假裝量測彼此獨立。解釋前先固定模型適用範圍：獨立隨機壓力標準差，不是最大門負荷或確定壓差界限。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「壓力量測誤差合成」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Combine standard deviations of two independent pressure channels in pascals, separately retaining common reference-pressure and calibration biases to avoid understated uncertainty. Variances of independent zero-mean errors add, giving a root-sum-square standard deviation. This is not a way to combine maximum tolerances or common bias. When a shared datum creates correlation, covariance terms belong in the calculation rather than assuming continued independence. Before interpreting the result, fix its domain: Independent random pressure standard deviations, not maximum door load or a deterministic pressure-difference bound. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Combining pressure measurement uncertainty” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：原創假想教學輸入：獨立壓力通道一標準差 s1=3 Pa；獨立壓力通道二標準差 s2=4 Pa。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Original hypothetical teaching inputs: first independent pressure standard deviation s1=3 Pa; second independent pressure standard deviation s2=4 Pa.","failure":"常見誤解：「任何兩個誤差都可以不問相關性直接平方和開根號」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Any two errors can be combined by root-sum-square without considering correlation.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「壓力量測誤差合成」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Combining pressure measurement uncertainty”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b386-v16-25-k1","title":"壓力量測誤差合成","titleEn":"Combining pressure measurement uncertainty","text":"本單元以帕斯卡為單位合成兩個獨立壓力通道的標準差，另列共用參考壓力與校正偏差以避免低估不確定度。獨立零均值誤差的變異數可以相加，因此標準差以平方和開根號合成。","textEn":"Combine standard deviations of two independent pressure channels in pascals, separately retaining common reference-pressure and calibration biases to avoid understated uncertainty. Variances of independent zero-mean errors add, giving a root-sum-square standard deviation.","sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"]},{"id":"b386-v16-25-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：任何兩個誤差都可以不問相關性直接平方和開根號 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Any two errors can be combined by root-sum-square without considering correlation. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「壓力量測誤差合成」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Combining pressure measurement uncertainty\" is correct?","options":["任何兩個誤差都可以不問相關性直接平方和開根號","本單元以帕斯卡為單位合成兩個獨立壓力通道的標準差，另列共用參考壓力與校正偏差以避免低估不確定度。","每個子系統平均很快就代表整體最壞延遲一定很短"],"optionsEn":["Any two errors can be combined by root-sum-square without considering correlation.","Combine standard deviations of two independent pressure channels in pascals, separately retaining common reference-pressure and calibration biases to avoid understated uncertainty.","Fast average subsystems guarantee a short worst-case end-to-end delay."],"answer":1,"explanation":"本單元以帕斯卡為單位合成兩個獨立壓力通道的標準差，另列共用參考壓力與校正偏差以避免低估不確定度。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Combine standard deviations of two independent pressure channels in pascals, separately retaining common reference-pressure and calibration biases to avoid understated uncertainty. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":25},{"id":"b386-v16-26","title":"壓力量測誤差合成：定量估算","titleEn":"Combining pressure measurement uncertainty: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"],"prerequisiteIds":["b386-v16-25"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「壓力量測誤差合成」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、速度、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Combining pressure measurement uncertainty” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, speed, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：原創假想教學輸入：獨立壓力通道一標準差 s1=3 Pa；獨立壓力通道二標準差 s2=4 Pa。公式 y=sqrt(s1*s1+s2*s2)，代入得 y=5 Pa。邊界：獨立隨機壓力標準差，不是最大門負荷或確定壓差界限。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（連續量可增加 10%；計數須保持整數；分貝量使用加減值），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Original hypothetical teaching inputs: first independent pressure standard deviation s1=3 Pa; second independent pressure standard deviation s2=4 Pa. Formula y=sqrt(s1*s1+s2*s2) gives y=5 Pa. Boundary: Independent random pressure standard deviations, not maximum door load or a deterministic pressure-difference bound. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example +10% for a continuous quantity; retain integers for counts and use additive changes for decibels), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：以重複量測估計標準差與相關係數，將固定偏差另列，再核對合成殘差。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Estimate standard deviations and correlation from repeated observations, separate fixed bias, and compare combined residuals.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b386-v16-26-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"原創假想教學輸入：獨立壓力通道一標準差 s1=3 Pa；獨立壓力通道二標準差 s2=4 Pa。公式 y=sqrt(s1*s1+s2*s2)，代入得 y=5 Pa。邊界：獨立隨機壓力標準差，不是最大門負荷或確定壓差界限。","textEn":"Original hypothetical teaching inputs: first independent pressure standard deviation s1=3 Pa; second independent pressure standard deviation s2=4 Pa. Formula y=sqrt(s1*s1+s2*s2) gives y=5 Pa. Boundary: Independent random pressure standard deviations, not maximum door load or a deterministic pressure-difference bound.","sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"]},{"id":"b386-v16-26-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real system, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「壓力量測誤差合成」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Combining pressure measurement uncertainty\", which statement holds?","options":["測試覆蓋率達到百分之百就等於零故障風險","一個測點風速符合目標就能證明整個煙流場符合需求","原創假想教學輸入：獨立壓力通道一標準差 s1=3 Pa；獨立壓力通道二標準差 s2=4 Pa。"],"optionsEn":["One hundred percent test coverage means zero failure risk.","One velocity reading at target proves that the entire smoke-flow field meets requirements.","Original hypothetical teaching inputs: first independent pressure standard deviation s1=3 Pa; second independent pressure standard deviation s2=4 Pa."],"answer":2,"explanation":"原創假想教學輸入：獨立壓力通道一標準差 s1=3 Pa；獨立壓力通道二標準差 s2=4 Pa。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Original hypothetical teaching inputs: first independent pressure standard deviation s1=3 Pa; second independent pressure standard deviation s2=4 Pa. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":26},{"id":"b386-v16-27","title":"壓力量測誤差合成：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Combining pressure measurement uncertainty: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"],"prerequisiteIds":["b386-v16-26"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「壓力量測誤差合成」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Combining pressure measurement uncertainty” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"以重複量測估計標準差與相關係數，將固定偏差另列，再核對合成殘差。以「壓力量測誤差合成」為驗證目標，先寫出預期變化方向及可分辨的替代原因，再保存原始讀值、單位、校正版本與時間窗。只有比較同一系統邊界的資料，才判定殘差是否支持這項機制。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Estimate standard deviations and correlation from repeated observations, separate fixed bias, and compare combined residuals. For combining pressure measurement uncertainty, state the expected direction and distinguishable alternative causes before collecting data. Retain raw readings, units, calibration version and observation window. Compare evidence within the same system boundary before deciding whether the residual supports this mechanism. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：只把獨立壓力通道一標準差 s1 從 3 改成 3.3 Pa（增加百分之十），其餘輸入固定。重算結果應由 5 變為 5.18556 Pa。先說明「壓力量測誤差合成」中變化的因果方向，再檢查適用邊界是否仍成立，提交計算與一個可反駁此解釋的觀測。","observationEn":"Site practice: Change only first independent pressure standard deviation s1 from 3 to 3.3 Pa (increase by ten percent), holding other inputs fixed. Recalculate 5 to 5.18556 Pa. Explain the causal direction for combining pressure measurement uncertainty, check that the stated boundary still holds, and submit the calculation plus one observation that could refute the explanation.","failure":"注意干擾：共同基準誤差會使所有讀值同向偏移，重複次數增加也無法把這種偏差平均掉。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、速度與操作條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: A common datum error shifts readings together, and additional repetition cannot average away that shared bias. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, speed and operating conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b386-v16-27-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以重複量測估計標準差與相關係數，將固定偏差另列，再核對合成殘差。以「壓力量測誤差合成」為驗證目標，先寫出預期變化方向及可分辨的替代原因，再保存原始讀值、單位、校正版本與時間窗。只有比較同一系統邊界的資料，才判定殘差是否支持這項機制。","textEn":"Estimate standard deviations and correlation from repeated observations, separate fixed bias, and compare combined residuals. For combining pressure measurement uncertainty, state the expected direction and distinguishable alternative causes before collecting data. Retain raw readings, units, calibration version and observation window. Compare evidence within the same system boundary before deciding whether the residual supports this mechanism.","sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"]},{"id":"b386-v16-27-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"只把獨立壓力通道一標準差 s1 從 3 改成 3.3 Pa（增加百分之十），其餘輸入固定。重算結果應由 5 變為 5.18556 Pa。先說明「壓力量測誤差合成」中變化的因果方向，再檢查適用邊界是否仍成立，提交計算與一個可反駁此解釋的觀測。","textEn":"Change only first independent pressure standard deviation s1 from 3 to 3.3 Pa (increase by ten percent), holding other inputs fixed. Recalculate 5 to 5.18556 Pa. Explain the causal direction for combining pressure measurement uncertainty, check that the stated boundary still holds, and submit the calculation plus one observation that could refute the explanation.","sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「壓力量測誤差合成」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Combining pressure measurement uncertainty\"?","options":["以重複量測估計標準差與相關係數，將固定偏差另列，再核對合成殘差。","量測時不必記錄溫度、速度、運行歷程與施工荷重，因為它們不會影響結果。","風機馬達正在轉動就表示所需通風量一定已達成"],"optionsEn":["Estimate standard deviations and correlation from repeated observations, separate fixed bias, and compare combined residuals.","Temperature, speed, operating history and construction loads need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","A running fan motor proves that the required airflow has been achieved."],"answer":0,"explanation":"以重複量測估計標準差與相關係數，將固定偏差另列，再核對合成殘差。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Estimate standard deviations and correlation from repeated observations, separate fixed bias, and compare combined residuals. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":27},{"id":"b386-v16-28","title":"壓力量測誤差合成：失效診斷","titleEn":"Combining pressure measurement uncertainty: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"],"prerequisiteIds":["b386-v16-27"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「壓力量測誤差合成」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Combining pressure measurement uncertainty” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"共同基準誤差會使所有讀值同向偏移，重複次數增加也無法把這種偏差平均掉。回到「壓力量測誤差合成」的輸入鏈逐項定位；先重播單一異常，再比較共同原因的組合。保留不確定項，避免為了讓結果符合預期而刪去不利證據。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體系統的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"A common datum error shifts readings together, and additional repetition cannot average away that shared bias. Trace the input chain for combining pressure measurement uncertainty. Replay one anomaly first, then compare common-cause combinations. Retain uncertain observations rather than discarding adverse evidence to force the expected conclusion. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：解釋前先固定模型適用範圍：獨立隨機壓力標準差，不是最大門負荷或確定壓差界限。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Before interpreting the result, fix its domain: Independent random pressure standard deviations, not maximum door load or a deterministic pressure-difference bound.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「任何兩個誤差都可以不問相關性直接平方和開根號」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Any two errors can be combined by root-sum-square without considering correlation.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b386-v16-28-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"共同基準誤差會使所有讀值同向偏移，重複次數增加也無法把這種偏差平均掉。回到「壓力量測誤差合成」的輸入鏈逐項定位；先重播單一異常，再比較共同原因的組合。保留不確定項，避免為了讓結果符合預期而刪去不利證據。","textEn":"A common datum error shifts readings together, and additional repetition cannot average away that shared bias. Trace the input chain for combining pressure measurement uncertainty. Replay one anomaly first, then compare common-cause combinations. Retain uncertain observations rather than discarding adverse evidence to force the expected conclusion.","sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"]},{"id":"b386-v16-28-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「壓力量測誤差合成」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Combining pressure measurement uncertainty\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自施工人員失誤，設計與細部不需要檢討。","共同基準誤差會使所有讀值同向偏移，重複次數增加也無法把這種偏差平均掉。","每個子系統平均很快就代表整體最壞延遲一定很短"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is a workmanship error, so design and detailing never need review.","A common datum error shifts readings together, and additional repetition cannot average away that shared bias.","Fast average subsystems guarantee a short worst-case end-to-end delay."],"answer":1,"explanation":"共同基準誤差會使所有讀值同向偏移，重複次數增加也無法把這種偏差平均掉。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"A common datum error shifts readings together, and additional repetition cannot average away that shared bias. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":28},{"id":"b386-v16-29","title":"風門反應時間鏈：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Damper-response timing chain: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"],"prerequisiteIds":["b386-v16-28"],"objective":"說明「風門反應時間鏈」如何影響地下車站活塞風控制的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Damper-response timing chain” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Piston-wind control in underground stations”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"本單元分開通訊命令、致動器移動和壓力實際變化，避免以風門已收到命令推論壓力已被抑制。端到端延遲由量測、通訊、運算與致動串接而成。改善最快的一段通常影響有限，且平均延遲不能代表最壞尾端；定義一致的起訖事件，才能避免子系統都量到好看的數值卻漏掉交接等待。解釋前先固定模型適用範圍：各階段串行且時間確定，沒有平行重疊或隨機尾端。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「風門反應時間鏈」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Separate command delivery, actuator movement and actual pressure change; command reception does not establish that the pressure transient has been reduced. End-to-end delay spans sensing, communication, computation and actuation. Improving the fastest stage often yields little benefit, and mean latency does not represent its worst tail. Consistent start and end events prevent subsystems from reporting attractive numbers while overlooking handoff queues. Before interpreting the result, fix its domain: Deterministic serial stages without overlap or random latency tails. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Damper-response timing chain” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：原創假想教學輸入：量測時間 sense=0.03 s；網路時間 network=0.08 s；運算時間 compute=0.02 s；致動時間 actuate=0.12 s。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Original hypothetical teaching inputs: sensing time sense=0.03 s; network time network=0.08 s; computation time compute=0.02 s; actuation time actuate=0.12 s.","failure":"常見誤解：「每個子系統平均很快就代表整體最壞延遲一定很短」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Fast average subsystems guarantee a short worst-case end-to-end delay.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「風門反應時間鏈」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Damper-response timing chain”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b386-v16-29-k1","title":"風門反應時間鏈","titleEn":"Damper-response timing chain","text":"本單元分開通訊命令、致動器移動和壓力實際變化，避免以風門已收到命令推論壓力已被抑制。端到端延遲由量測、通訊、運算與致動串接而成。","textEn":"Separate command delivery, actuator movement and actual pressure change; command reception does not establish that the pressure transient has been reduced. End-to-end delay spans sensing, communication, computation and actuation.","sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"]},{"id":"b386-v16-29-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：每個子系統平均很快就代表整體最壞延遲一定很短 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Fast average subsystems guarantee a short worst-case end-to-end delay. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「風門反應時間鏈」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Damper-response timing chain\" is correct?","options":["每個子系統平均很快就代表整體最壞延遲一定很短","狀態變數多一個只會多出一種狀態組合","本單元分開通訊命令、致動器移動和壓力實際變化，避免以風門已收到命令推論壓力已被抑制。"],"optionsEn":["Fast average subsystems guarantee a short worst-case end-to-end delay.","Adding one Boolean state variable creates only one additional combination.","Separate command delivery, actuator movement and actual pressure change; command reception does not establish that the pressure transient has been reduced."],"answer":2,"explanation":"本單元分開通訊命令、致動器移動和壓力實際變化，避免以風門已收到命令推論壓力已被抑制。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Separate command delivery, actuator movement and actual pressure change; command reception does not establish that the pressure transient has been reduced. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":29},{"id":"b386-v16-30","title":"風門反應時間鏈：定量估算","titleEn":"Damper-response timing chain: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"],"prerequisiteIds":["b386-v16-29"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「風門反應時間鏈」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、速度、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Damper-response timing chain” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, speed, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：原創假想教學輸入：量測時間 sense=0.03 s；網路時間 network=0.08 s；運算時間 compute=0.02 s；致動時間 actuate=0.12 s。公式 y=sense+network+compute+actuate，代入得 y=0.25 s。邊界：各階段串行且時間確定，沒有平行重疊或隨機尾端。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（連續量可增加 10%；計數須保持整數；分貝量使用加減值），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Original hypothetical teaching inputs: sensing time sense=0.03 s; network time network=0.08 s; computation time compute=0.02 s; actuation time actuate=0.12 s. Formula y=sense+network+compute+actuate gives y=0.25 s. Boundary: Deterministic serial stages without overlap or random latency tails. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example +10% for a continuous quantity; retain integers for counts and use additive changes for decibels), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：沿同一事件編號串接時間戳，檢查每一段邊界是否重疊或漏算，並注入負載重測。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Follow one event identifier through timestamps, check stage boundaries for overlap or gaps, and repeat under injected load.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b386-v16-30-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"原創假想教學輸入：量測時間 sense=0.03 s；網路時間 network=0.08 s；運算時間 compute=0.02 s；致動時間 actuate=0.12 s。公式 y=sense+network+compute+actuate，代入得 y=0.25 s。邊界：各階段串行且時間確定，沒有平行重疊或隨機尾端。","textEn":"Original hypothetical teaching inputs: sensing time sense=0.03 s; network time network=0.08 s; computation time compute=0.02 s; actuation time actuate=0.12 s. Formula y=sense+network+compute+actuate gives y=0.25 s. Boundary: Deterministic serial stages without overlap or random latency tails.","sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"]},{"id":"b386-v16-30-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real system, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「風門反應時間鏈」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Damper-response timing chain\", which statement holds?","options":["原創假想教學輸入：量測時間 sense=0.03 s。","風速加倍時動壓也只會跟著加倍","開口壓差增加四倍時流量一定增加四倍"],"optionsEn":["Original hypothetical teaching inputs: sensing time sense=0.03 s; network time network=0.08 s; computation time compute=0.02 s; actuation time actuate=0.12 s.","Doubling air speed merely doubles dynamic pressure.","Quadrupling pressure difference necessarily quadruples opening flow."],"answer":0,"explanation":"原創假想教學輸入：量測時間 sense=0.03 s；網路時間 network=0.08 s；運算時間 compute=0.02 s；致動時間 actuate=0.12 s。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Original hypothetical teaching inputs: sensing time sense=0.03 s; network time network=0.08 s; computation time compute=0.02 s; actuation time actuate=0.12 s. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":30},{"id":"b386-v16-31","title":"風門反應時間鏈：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Damper-response timing chain: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"],"prerequisiteIds":["b386-v16-30"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「風門反應時間鏈」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Damper-response timing chain” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"沿同一事件編號串接時間戳，檢查每一段邊界是否重疊或漏算，並注入負載重測。以「風門反應時間鏈」為驗證目標，先寫出預期變化方向及可分辨的替代原因，再保存原始讀值、單位、校正版本與時間窗。只有比較同一系統邊界的資料，才判定殘差是否支持這項機制。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Follow one event identifier through timestamps, check stage boundaries for overlap or gaps, and repeat under injected load. For damper-response timing chain, state the expected direction and distinguishable alternative causes before collecting data. Retain raw readings, units, calibration version and observation window. Compare evidence within the same system boundary before deciding whether the residual supports this mechanism. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：只把網路時間 network 從 0.08 改成 0.088 s（增加百分之十），其餘輸入固定。重算結果應由 0.25 變為 0.258 s。先說明「風門反應時間鏈」中變化的因果方向，再檢查適用邊界是否仍成立，提交計算與一個可反駁此解釋的觀測。","observationEn":"Site practice: Change only network time network from 0.08 to 0.088 s (increase by ten percent), holding other inputs fixed. Recalculate 0.25 to 0.258 s. Explain the causal direction for damper-response timing chain, check that the stated boundary still holds, and submit the calculation plus one observation that could refute the explanation.","failure":"注意干擾：時間基準不同可造成負延遲假象；漏記排隊會使快速單元測試無法預測整合表現。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、速度與操作條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Different clock references can create apparently negative delays; omitted queues prevent fast unit tests from predicting integrated performance. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, speed and operating conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b386-v16-31-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"沿同一事件編號串接時間戳，檢查每一段邊界是否重疊或漏算，並注入負載重測。以「風門反應時間鏈」為驗證目標，先寫出預期變化方向及可分辨的替代原因，再保存原始讀值、單位、校正版本與時間窗。只有比較同一系統邊界的資料，才判定殘差是否支持這項機制。","textEn":"Follow one event identifier through timestamps, check stage boundaries for overlap or gaps, and repeat under injected load. For damper-response timing chain, state the expected direction and distinguishable alternative causes before collecting data. Retain raw readings, units, calibration version and observation window. Compare evidence within the same system boundary before deciding whether the residual supports this mechanism.","sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"]},{"id":"b386-v16-31-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"只把網路時間 network 從 0.08 改成 0.088 s（增加百分之十），其餘輸入固定。重算結果應由 0.25 變為 0.258 s。先說明「風門反應時間鏈」中變化的因果方向，再檢查適用邊界是否仍成立，提交計算與一個可反駁此解釋的觀測。","textEn":"Change only network time network from 0.08 to 0.088 s (increase by ten percent), holding other inputs fixed. Recalculate 0.25 to 0.258 s. Explain the causal direction for damper-response timing chain, check that the stated boundary still holds, and submit the calculation plus one observation that could refute the explanation.","sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「風門反應時間鏈」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Damper-response timing chain\"?","options":["沿用另一處鐵路設施或路線的量測結果，就可視為本工程已完成驗證。","沿同一事件編號串接時間戳，檢查每一段邊界是否重疊或漏算，並注入負載重測。","把相鄰壓力資料內插成更多點就能恢復任何短暫峰值"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another railway facility or route counts as verifying this structure.","Follow one event identifier through timestamps, check stage boundaries for overlap or gaps, and repeat under injected load.","Interpolating extra points between pressure observations can recover every brief pressure peak."],"answer":1,"explanation":"沿同一事件編號串接時間戳，檢查每一段邊界是否重疊或漏算，並注入負載重測。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Follow one event identifier through timestamps, check stage boundaries for overlap or gaps, and repeat under injected load. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":31},{"id":"b386-v16-32","title":"風門反應時間鏈：失效診斷","titleEn":"Damper-response timing chain: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"],"prerequisiteIds":["b386-v16-31"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「風門反應時間鏈」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Damper-response timing chain” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"時間基準不同可造成負延遲假象；漏記排隊會使快速單元測試無法預測整合表現。回到「風門反應時間鏈」的輸入鏈逐項定位；先重播單一異常，再比較共同原因的組合。保留不確定項，避免為了讓結果符合預期而刪去不利證據。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體系統的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Different clock references can create apparently negative delays; omitted queues prevent fast unit tests from predicting integrated performance. Trace the input chain for damper-response timing chain. Replay one anomaly first, then compare common-cause combinations. Retain uncertain observations rather than discarding adverse evidence to force the expected conclusion. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：解釋前先固定模型適用範圍：各階段串行且時間確定，沒有平行重疊或隨機尾端。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Before interpreting the result, fix its domain: Deterministic serial stages without overlap or random latency tails.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「每個子系統平均很快就代表整體最壞延遲一定很短」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Fast average subsystems guarantee a short worst-case end-to-end delay.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b386-v16-32-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"時間基準不同可造成負延遲假象；漏記排隊會使快速單元測試無法預測整合表現。回到「風門反應時間鏈」的輸入鏈逐項定位；先重播單一異常，再比較共同原因的組合。保留不確定項，避免為了讓結果符合預期而刪去不利證據。","textEn":"Different clock references can create apparently negative delays; omitted queues prevent fast unit tests from predicting integrated performance. Trace the input chain for damper-response timing chain. Replay one anomaly first, then compare common-cause combinations. Retain uncertain observations rather than discarding adverse evidence to force the expected conclusion.","sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"]},{"id":"b386-v16-32-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「風門反應時間鏈」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Damper-response timing chain\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["補一層塗料或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數劣化問題。","狀態變數多一個只會多出一種狀態組合","時間基準不同可造成負延遲假象；漏記排隊會使快速單元測試無法預測整合表現。"],"optionsEn":["Adding a coat of paint or widening the acceptance limits solves most deterioration problems.","Adding one Boolean state variable creates only one additional combination.","Different clock references can create apparently negative delays; omitted queues prevent fast unit tests from predicting integrated performance."],"answer":2,"explanation":"時間基準不同可造成負延遲假象；漏記排隊會使快速單元測試無法預測整合表現。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Different clock references can create apparently negative delays; omitted queues prevent fast unit tests from predicting integrated performance. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":32}],"order":4},{"id":"b386-v16-s5","title":"通風模式相容狀態與不同列車通過情境","titleEn":"Compatibility of ventilation modes & Scenarios for different train passages","description":"本階段聚焦「通風模式相容狀態」與「不同列車通過情境」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Compatibility of ventilation modes\" and \"Scenarios for different train passages\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b386-v16-33","title":"通風模式相容狀態：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Compatibility of ventilation modes: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"],"prerequisiteIds":["b386-v16-32"],"objective":"說明「通風模式相容狀態」如何影響地下車站活塞風控制的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Compatibility of ventilation modes” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Piston-wind control in underground stations”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"本單元檢查正常舒適通風與緊急煙控的模式交接，列出相互矛盾的風門組合而不提供現場操作順序。布林狀態組合隨變數個數指數成長，這說明逐一人工檢查很快失去效率。可達性約束能排除不可能組合，但刪除條件必須有證據；安全性質通常針對所有可達狀態，而非幾個畫面上看起來合理的狀態。解釋前先固定模型適用範圍：未限制的布林笛卡兒積；實際可達狀態通常較少，但需另證明。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「通風模式相容狀態」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Check handover between comfort ventilation and emergency smoke control, listing contradictory damper states without giving field operating sequences. Boolean combinations grow exponentially with variable count, explaining why manual enumeration soon becomes ineffective. Reachability constraints can eliminate impossible combinations, but each exclusion needs justification. Safety properties normally concern every reachable state rather than a few states that look plausible on a display. Before interpreting the result, fix its domain: Unconstrained Boolean Cartesian product; actual reachability can be smaller but must be established separately. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Compatibility of ventilation modes” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：原創假想教學輸入：布林變數數量 bits=8 bits。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Original hypothetical teaching inputs: number of Boolean state variables bits=8 bits.","failure":"常見誤解：「狀態變數多一個只會多出一種狀態組合」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Adding one Boolean state variable creates only one additional combination.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「通風模式相容狀態」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Compatibility of ventilation modes”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b386-v16-33-k1","title":"通風模式相容狀態","titleEn":"Compatibility of ventilation modes","text":"本單元檢查正常舒適通風與緊急煙控的模式交接，列出相互矛盾的風門組合而不提供現場操作順序。布林狀態組合隨變數個數指數成長，這說明逐一人工檢查很快失去效率。","textEn":"Check handover between comfort ventilation and emergency smoke control, listing contradictory damper states without giving field operating sequences. Boolean combinations grow exponentially with variable count, explaining why manual enumeration soon becomes ineffective.","sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"]},{"id":"b386-v16-33-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：狀態變數多一個只會多出一種狀態組合 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Adding one Boolean state variable creates only one additional combination. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「通風模式相容狀態」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Compatibility of ventilation modes\" is correct?","options":["本單元檢查正常舒適通風與緊急煙控的模式交接，列出相互矛盾的風門組合而不提供現場操作順序。","狀態變數多一個只會多出一種狀態組合","測試覆蓋率達到百分之百就等於零故障風險"],"optionsEn":["Check handover between comfort ventilation and emergency smoke control, listing contradictory damper states without giving field operating sequences.","Adding one Boolean state variable creates only one additional combination.","One hundred percent test coverage means zero failure risk."],"answer":0,"explanation":"本單元檢查正常舒適通風與緊急煙控的模式交接，列出相互矛盾的風門組合而不提供現場操作順序。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Check handover between comfort ventilation and emergency smoke control, listing contradictory damper states without giving field operating sequences. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":33},{"id":"b386-v16-34","title":"通風模式相容狀態：定量估算","titleEn":"Compatibility of ventilation modes: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"],"prerequisiteIds":["b386-v16-33"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「通風模式相容狀態」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、速度、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Compatibility of ventilation modes” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, speed, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：原創假想教學輸入：布林變數數量 bits=8 bits。公式 y=2**bits，代入得 y=256 states。邊界：未限制的布林笛卡兒積；實際可達狀態通常較少，但需另證明。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（連續量可增加 10%；計數須保持整數；分貝量使用加減值），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Original hypothetical teaching inputs: number of Boolean state variables bits=8 bits. Formula y=2**bits gives y=256 states. Boundary: Unconstrained Boolean Cartesian product; actual reachability can be smaller but must be established separately. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example +10% for a continuous quantity; retain integers for counts and use additive changes for decibels), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：用小型模型列舉轉移，再與需求允許的轉移表比較，對被排除狀態留下理由。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Enumerate transitions in a small model, compare against the required transition table, and document reasons for excluded states.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b386-v16-34-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"原創假想教學輸入：布林變數數量 bits=8 bits。公式 y=2**bits，代入得 y=256 states。邊界：未限制的布林笛卡兒積；實際可達狀態通常較少，但需另證明。","textEn":"Original hypothetical teaching inputs: number of Boolean state variables bits=8 bits. Formula y=2**bits gives y=256 states. Boundary: Unconstrained Boolean Cartesian product; actual reachability can be smaller but must be established separately.","sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"]},{"id":"b386-v16-34-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real system, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「通風模式相容狀態」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Compatibility of ventilation modes\", which statement holds?","options":["一個測點風速符合目標就能證明整個煙流場符合需求","原創假想教學輸入：布林變數數量 bits=8 bits。","風機馬達正在轉動就表示所需通風量一定已達成"],"optionsEn":["One velocity reading at target proves that the entire smoke-flow field meets requirements.","Original hypothetical teaching inputs: number of Boolean state variables bits=8 bits.","A running fan motor proves that the required airflow has been achieved."],"answer":1,"explanation":"原創假想教學輸入：布林變數數量 bits=8 bits。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Original hypothetical teaching inputs: number of Boolean state variables bits=8 bits. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":34},{"id":"b386-v16-35","title":"通風模式相容狀態：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Compatibility of ventilation modes: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"],"prerequisiteIds":["b386-v16-34"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「通風模式相容狀態」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Compatibility of ventilation modes” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"用小型模型列舉轉移，再與需求允許的轉移表比較，對被排除狀態留下理由。以「通風模式相容狀態」為驗證目標，先寫出預期變化方向及可分辨的替代原因，再保存原始讀值、單位、校正版本與時間窗。只有比較同一系統邊界的資料，才判定殘差是否支持這項機制。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Enumerate transitions in a small model, compare against the required transition table, and document reasons for excluded states. For compatibility of ventilation modes, state the expected direction and distinguishable alternative causes before collecting data. Retain raw readings, units, calibration version and observation window. Compare evidence within the same system boundary before deciding whether the residual supports this mechanism. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：只把布林變數數量 bits 從 8 改成 9 bits（增加一個可計數單位），其餘輸入固定。重算結果應由 256 變為 512 states。先說明「通風模式相容狀態」中變化的因果方向，再檢查適用邊界是否仍成立，提交計算與一個可反駁此解釋的觀測。","observationEn":"Site practice: Change only number of Boolean state variables bits from 8 to 9 bits (increase by one whole count), holding other inputs fixed. Recalculate 256 to 512 states. Explain the causal direction for compatibility of ventilation modes, check that the stated boundary still holds, and submit the calculation plus one observation that could refute the explanation.","failure":"注意干擾：把感測器故障狀態預先刪掉會讓證明失去關鍵邊界，狀態抽象過粗也可能隱藏時序競爭。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、速度與操作條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Excluding sensor-fault states can remove the crucial boundary from a proof; overly coarse abstraction may hide timing races. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, speed and operating conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b386-v16-35-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"用小型模型列舉轉移，再與需求允許的轉移表比較，對被排除狀態留下理由。以「通風模式相容狀態」為驗證目標，先寫出預期變化方向及可分辨的替代原因，再保存原始讀值、單位、校正版本與時間窗。只有比較同一系統邊界的資料，才判定殘差是否支持這項機制。","textEn":"Enumerate transitions in a small model, compare against the required transition table, and document reasons for excluded states. For compatibility of ventilation modes, state the expected direction and distinguishable alternative causes before collecting data. Retain raw readings, units, calibration version and observation window. Compare evidence within the same system boundary before deciding whether the residual supports this mechanism.","sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"]},{"id":"b386-v16-35-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"只把布林變數數量 bits 從 8 改成 9 bits（增加一個可計數單位），其餘輸入固定。重算結果應由 256 變為 512 states。先說明「通風模式相容狀態」中變化的因果方向，再檢查適用邊界是否仍成立，提交計算與一個可反駁此解釋的觀測。","textEn":"Change only number of Boolean state variables bits from 8 to 9 bits (increase by one whole count), holding other inputs fixed. Recalculate 256 to 512 states. Explain the causal direction for compatibility of ventilation modes, check that the stated boundary still holds, and submit the calculation plus one observation that could refute the explanation.","sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「通風模式相容狀態」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Compatibility of ventilation modes\"?","options":["只看一次讀值或外觀即可判定合格，不需要基準點、參考試體或重複量測。","測試開始時時鐘一致就能保證整天時間戳都一致","用小型模型列舉轉移，再與需求允許的轉移表比較，對被排除狀態留下理由。"],"optionsEn":["A single reading or a visual impression is enough to accept the work; no datum, reference specimen or repeat measurement is needed.","Clocks aligned at test start remain aligned for the entire day.","Enumerate transitions in a small model, compare against the required transition table, and document reasons for excluded states."],"answer":2,"explanation":"用小型模型列舉轉移，再與需求允許的轉移表比較，對被排除狀態留下理由。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Enumerate transitions in a small model, compare against the required transition table, and document reasons for excluded states. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":35},{"id":"b386-v16-36","title":"通風模式相容狀態：失效診斷","titleEn":"Compatibility of ventilation modes: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"],"prerequisiteIds":["b386-v16-35"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「通風模式相容狀態」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Compatibility of ventilation modes” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"把感測器故障狀態預先刪掉會讓證明失去關鍵邊界，狀態抽象過粗也可能隱藏時序競爭。回到「通風模式相容狀態」的輸入鏈逐項定位；先重播單一異常，再比較共同原因的組合。保留不確定項，避免為了讓結果符合預期而刪去不利證據。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體系統的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Excluding sensor-fault states can remove the crucial boundary from a proof; overly coarse abstraction may hide timing races. Trace the input chain for compatibility of ventilation modes. Replay one anomaly first, then compare common-cause combinations. Retain uncertain observations rather than discarding adverse evidence to force the expected conclusion. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：解釋前先固定模型適用範圍：未限制的布林笛卡兒積；實際可達狀態通常較少，但需另證明。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Before interpreting the result, fix its domain: Unconstrained Boolean Cartesian product; actual reachability can be smaller but must be established separately.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「狀態變數多一個只會多出一種狀態組合」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Adding one Boolean state variable creates only one additional combination.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b386-v16-36-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"把感測器故障狀態預先刪掉會讓證明失去關鍵邊界，狀態抽象過粗也可能隱藏時序競爭。回到「通風模式相容狀態」的輸入鏈逐項定位；先重播單一異常，再比較共同原因的組合。保留不確定項，避免為了讓結果符合預期而刪去不利證據。","textEn":"Excluding sensor-fault states can remove the crucial boundary from a proof; overly coarse abstraction may hide timing races. Trace the input chain for compatibility of ventilation modes. Replay one anomaly first, then compare common-cause combinations. Retain uncertain observations rather than discarding adverse evidence to force the expected conclusion.","sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"]},{"id":"b386-v16-36-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「通風模式相容狀態」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Compatibility of ventilation modes\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["把感測器故障狀態預先刪掉會讓證明失去關鍵邊界，狀態抽象過粗也可能隱藏時序競爭。","裂縫或異常只出現一次就可以忽略，不需要記錄或追蹤。","測試覆蓋率達到百分之百就等於零故障風險"],"optionsEn":["Excluding sensor-fault states can remove the crucial boundary from a proof; overly coarse abstraction may hide timing races.","A crack or anomaly that appears only once can be ignored without logging or follow-up.","One hundred percent test coverage means zero failure risk."],"answer":0,"explanation":"把感測器故障狀態預先刪掉會讓證明失去關鍵邊界，狀態抽象過粗也可能隱藏時序競爭。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Excluding sensor-fault states can remove the crucial boundary from a proof; overly coarse abstraction may hide timing races. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":36},{"id":"b386-v16-37","title":"不同列車通過情境：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Scenarios for different train passages: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"],"prerequisiteIds":["b386-v16-36"],"objective":"說明「不同列車通過情境」如何影響地下車站活塞風控制的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Scenarios for different train passages” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Piston-wind control in underground stations”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"本單元分別比較停站、通過與對向列車事件，將車門和旁通開口狀態保留為獨立測試因素。測試覆蓋率只對已定義的分母有意義。需求、狀態、轉移與危害各有不同分母，執行很多正常案例仍可能漏掉罕見但重要的交接；同一案例重跑多次不會自動增加獨立需求的覆蓋。解釋前先固定模型適用範圍：計數式已知案例覆蓋，不是失效機率或安全完整性量化。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「不同列車通過情境」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Compare stopping, through-running and opposing-train events, retaining door and bypass states as independent test factors. Coverage is meaningful only relative to its defined denominator. Requirements, states, transitions and hazards have different denominators. Many normal cases can still omit a rare but important handoff, and repeating one case does not automatically cover additional independent requirements. Before interpreting the result, fix its domain: Count-based coverage of known cases, not a probability of failure or a safety-integrity measure. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Scenarios for different train passages” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：原創假想教學輸入：已執行案例 tested=72 cases；已定義案例 total=90 cases。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Original hypothetical teaching inputs: executed cases tested=72 cases; defined cases total=90 cases.","failure":"常見誤解：「測試覆蓋率達到百分之百就等於零故障風險」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"One hundred percent test coverage means zero failure risk.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「不同列車通過情境」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Scenarios for different train passages”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b386-v16-37-k1","title":"不同列車通過情境","titleEn":"Scenarios for different train passages","text":"本單元分別比較停站、通過與對向列車事件，將車門和旁通開口狀態保留為獨立測試因素。測試覆蓋率只對已定義的分母有意義。","textEn":"Compare stopping, through-running and opposing-train events, retaining door and bypass states as independent test factors. Coverage is meaningful only relative to its defined denominator.","sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"]},{"id":"b386-v16-37-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：測試覆蓋率達到百分之百就等於零故障風險 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: One hundred percent test coverage means zero failure risk. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「不同列車通過情境」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Scenarios for different train passages\" is correct?","options":["測試覆蓋率達到百分之百就等於零故障風險","本單元分別比較停站、通過與對向列車事件，將車門和旁通開口狀態保留為獨立測試因素。","風速加倍時動壓也只會跟著加倍"],"optionsEn":["One hundred percent test coverage means zero failure risk.","Compare stopping, through-running and opposing-train events, retaining door and bypass states as independent test factors.","Doubling air speed merely doubles dynamic pressure."],"answer":1,"explanation":"本單元分別比較停站、通過與對向列車事件，將車門和旁通開口狀態保留為獨立測試因素。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Compare stopping, through-running and opposing-train events, retaining door and bypass states as independent test factors. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":37},{"id":"b386-v16-38","title":"不同列車通過情境：定量估算","titleEn":"Scenarios for different train passages: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"],"prerequisiteIds":["b386-v16-37"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「不同列車通過情境」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、速度、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Scenarios for different train passages” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, speed, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：原創假想教學輸入：已執行案例 tested=72 cases；已定義案例 total=90 cases。公式 y=tested/total，代入得 y=0.8 1。邊界：計數式已知案例覆蓋，不是失效機率或安全完整性量化。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（連續量可增加 10%；計數須保持整數；分貝量使用加減值），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Original hypothetical teaching inputs: executed cases tested=72 cases; defined cases total=90 cases. Formula y=tested/total gives y=0.8 1. Boundary: Count-based coverage of known cases, not a probability of failure or a safety-integrity measure. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example +10% for a continuous quantity; retain integers for counts and use additive changes for decibels), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：建立需求到案例的一對多追溯表，將未測、失敗與不適用分開，抽查原始證據。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Build requirement-to-case traceability, separate untested, failed and inapplicable cases, and sample raw evidence.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b386-v16-38-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"原創假想教學輸入：已執行案例 tested=72 cases；已定義案例 total=90 cases。公式 y=tested/total，代入得 y=0.8 1。邊界：計數式已知案例覆蓋，不是失效機率或安全完整性量化。","textEn":"Original hypothetical teaching inputs: executed cases tested=72 cases; defined cases total=90 cases. Formula y=tested/total gives y=0.8 1. Boundary: Count-based coverage of known cases, not a probability of failure or a safety-integrity measure.","sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"]},{"id":"b386-v16-38-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real system, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「不同列車通過情境」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Scenarios for different train passages\", which statement holds?","options":["開口壓差增加四倍時流量一定增加四倍","把相鄰壓力資料內插成更多點就能恢復任何短暫峰值","原創假想教學輸入：已執行案例 tested=72 cases；已定義案例 total=90 cases。"],"optionsEn":["Quadrupling pressure difference necessarily quadruples opening flow.","Interpolating extra points between pressure observations can recover every brief pressure peak.","Original hypothetical teaching inputs: executed cases tested=72 cases; defined cases total=90 cases."],"answer":2,"explanation":"原創假想教學輸入：已執行案例 tested=72 cases；已定義案例 total=90 cases。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Original hypothetical teaching inputs: executed cases tested=72 cases; defined cases total=90 cases. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":38},{"id":"b386-v16-39","title":"不同列車通過情境：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Scenarios for different train passages: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"],"prerequisiteIds":["b386-v16-38"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「不同列車通過情境」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Scenarios for different train passages” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"建立需求到案例的一對多追溯表，將未測、失敗與不適用分開，抽查原始證據。以「不同列車通過情境」為驗證目標，先寫出預期變化方向及可分辨的替代原因，再保存原始讀值、單位、校正版本與時間窗。只有比較同一系統邊界的資料，才判定殘差是否支持這項機制。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Build requirement-to-case traceability, separate untested, failed and inapplicable cases, and sample raw evidence. For scenarios for different train passages, state the expected direction and distinguishable alternative causes before collecting data. Retain raw readings, units, calibration version and observation window. Compare evidence within the same system boundary before deciding whether the residual supports this mechanism. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：只把已執行案例 tested 從 72 改成 73 cases（增加一個可計數單位），其餘輸入固定。重算結果應由 0.8 變為 0.811111 1。先說明「不同列車通過情境」中變化的因果方向，再檢查適用邊界是否仍成立，提交計算與一個可反駁此解釋的觀測。","observationEn":"Site practice: Change only executed cases tested from 72 to 73 cases (increase by one whole count), holding other inputs fixed. Recalculate 0.8 to 0.811111 1. Explain the causal direction for scenarios for different train passages, check that the stated boundary still holds, and submit the calculation plus one observation that could refute the explanation.","failure":"注意干擾：縮小分母可讓覆蓋率看似提高，重複案例也可能掩蓋邊界狀態根本未被執行。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、速度與操作條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Shrinking the denominator makes coverage look better; duplicate cases can hide boundary states that were never exercised. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, speed and operating conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b386-v16-39-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"建立需求到案例的一對多追溯表，將未測、失敗與不適用分開，抽查原始證據。以「不同列車通過情境」為驗證目標，先寫出預期變化方向及可分辨的替代原因，再保存原始讀值、單位、校正版本與時間窗。只有比較同一系統邊界的資料，才判定殘差是否支持這項機制。","textEn":"Build requirement-to-case traceability, separate untested, failed and inapplicable cases, and sample raw evidence. For scenarios for different train passages, state the expected direction and distinguishable alternative causes before collecting data. Retain raw readings, units, calibration version and observation window. Compare evidence within the same system boundary before deciding whether the residual supports this mechanism.","sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"]},{"id":"b386-v16-39-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"只把已執行案例 tested 從 72 改成 73 cases（增加一個可計數單位），其餘輸入固定。重算結果應由 0.8 變為 0.811111 1。先說明「不同列車通過情境」中變化的因果方向，再檢查適用邊界是否仍成立，提交計算與一個可反駁此解釋的觀測。","textEn":"Change only executed cases tested from 72 to 73 cases (increase by one whole count), holding other inputs fixed. Recalculate 0.8 to 0.811111 1. Explain the causal direction for scenarios for different train passages, check that the stated boundary still holds, and submit the calculation plus one observation that could refute the explanation.","sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「不同列車通過情境」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Scenarios for different train passages\"?","options":["建立需求到案例的一對多追溯表，將未測、失敗與不適用分開，抽查原始證據。","不確定度太難估計，報告中只寫最佳值即可。","任何兩個誤差都可以不問相關性直接平方和開根號"],"optionsEn":["Build requirement-to-case traceability, separate untested, failed and inapplicable cases, and sample raw evidence.","Uncertainty is too hard to estimate, so the report may state only the best value.","Any two errors can be combined by root-sum-square without considering correlation."],"answer":0,"explanation":"建立需求到案例的一對多追溯表，將未測、失敗與不適用分開，抽查原始證據。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Build requirement-to-case traceability, separate untested, failed and inapplicable cases, and sample raw evidence. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":39},{"id":"b386-v16-40","title":"不同列車通過情境：失效診斷","titleEn":"Scenarios for different train passages: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"],"prerequisiteIds":["b386-v16-39"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「不同列車通過情境」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Scenarios for different train passages” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"縮小分母可讓覆蓋率看似提高，重複案例也可能掩蓋邊界狀態根本未被執行。回到「不同列車通過情境」的輸入鏈逐項定位；先重播單一異常，再比較共同原因的組合。保留不確定項，避免為了讓結果符合預期而刪去不利證據。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體系統的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Shrinking the denominator makes coverage look better; duplicate cases can hide boundary states that were never exercised. Trace the input chain for scenarios for different train passages. Replay one anomaly first, then compare common-cause combinations. Retain uncertain observations rather than discarding adverse evidence to force the expected conclusion. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：解釋前先固定模型適用範圍：計數式已知案例覆蓋，不是失效機率或安全完整性量化。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Before interpreting the result, fix its domain: Count-based coverage of known cases, not a probability of failure or a safety-integrity measure.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「測試覆蓋率達到百分之百就等於零故障風險」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"One hundred percent test coverage means zero failure risk.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b386-v16-40-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"縮小分母可讓覆蓋率看似提高，重複案例也可能掩蓋邊界狀態根本未被執行。回到「不同列車通過情境」的輸入鏈逐項定位；先重播單一異常，再比較共同原因的組合。保留不確定項，避免為了讓結果符合預期而刪去不利證據。","textEn":"Shrinking the denominator makes coverage look better; duplicate cases can hide boundary states that were never exercised. Trace the input chain for scenarios for different train passages. Replay one anomaly first, then compare common-cause combinations. Retain uncertain observations rather than discarding adverse evidence to force the expected conclusion.","sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"]},{"id":"b386-v16-40-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「不同列車通過情境」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Scenarios for different train passages\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["先更換最貴的構件；只要症狀消失，就代表已找到根因。","縮小分母可讓覆蓋率看似提高，重複案例也可能掩蓋邊界狀態根本未被執行。","風速加倍時動壓也只會跟著加倍"],"optionsEn":["Replace the most expensive component first; if the symptom disappears, the root cause has been found.","Shrinking the denominator makes coverage look better; duplicate cases can hide boundary states that were never exercised.","Doubling air speed merely doubles dynamic pressure."],"answer":1,"explanation":"縮小分母可讓覆蓋率看似提高，重複案例也可能掩蓋邊界狀態根本未被執行。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Shrinking the denominator makes coverage look better; duplicate cases can hide boundary states that were never exercised. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":40}],"order":5}],"sourceIds":["v16s-fta-emergency","v16s-passenger-flow","v16s-rb-station","v16s-taipei-main-reference","v16s-kings-cross-reference"],"curriculumVersion":16,"stepCount":40,"estimatedMinutes":1000,"flowDiagram":"assets/diagrams/v16-b386-zh.svg","flowDiagramEn":"assets/diagrams/v16-b386-en.svg"}};
